<!-- ==================================================================
     KHAATA — BUILD LOG
     Sprint 19 — Voice-First AI Finance Assistant (App.Voice.Bridge — new)
       App version bumped: 1.16.0 -> 1.17.0
       Mission: make voice the PRIMARY way to use Khaata, with a real
       hands-free, ChatGPT-style back-and-forth — without building a
       second brain. This sprint adds exactly one new module,
       App.Voice.Bridge, whose entire job is orchestration (when to
       listen, when to speak, how to keep a conversation flowing). It
       contains NO natural-language understanding of its own — every
       recognized sentence is handed, verbatim, to the EXISTING
       App.Chat.sendMessage() (the same function the typed 💬 chat box
       already calls), which is what actually understands Hindi /
       English / Hinglish / mixed language, fills in slots, asks
       follow-ups, and saves data (Sprints 15-18). One source of truth
       for "what did the user mean" — voice and typing are just two
       doors into the same room.
         App.Voice.Bridge (new)   — the only new module. Subscribes to
                               the REAL App.Voice.Recognition/Synthesis/
                               Manager built in an earlier sprint
                               (previously wired to a Foundation-only
                               placeholder parser that always reported
                               "not recognized") and to the new
                               App.Chat.onAIMessage() hook. Provides
                               startConversation()/stopConversation(),
                               continuous hands-free listening (mic
                               re-opens after every reply once
                               "Continuous listening" is on), real
                               barge-in (speaking is cancelled the
                               moment the user starts talking over it,
                               instead of talking past them), silence
                               handling (a couple of quiet retries, then
                               a gentle pause — never an infinite loop),
                               and a "Voice confirmation mode" setting
                               so Yes/No/Why prompts can either keep
                               listening automatically or wait for an
                               explicit mic tap.
         App.Voice.Manager.processSpeech — one additive line: after its
                               existing (still-untouched) placeholder
                               pipeline runs, it now also hands the
                               transcript to App.Voice.Bridge. The
                               placeholder Parser.parseCommand() keeps
                               reporting recognized:false exactly as
                               before — nothing here was removed.
         App.Voice.Recognition — `continuous` now reflects the real
                               "Continuous listening" setting when a
                               session starts, and a no-speech result
                               now emits a `recognition:nospeech` event
                               (previously swallowed silently) so Bridge
                               can react. Everything else (start/stop/
                               abort, event names, error handling)
                               unchanged.
         App.Voice.Config.SETTINGS_DEFAULTS — two real settings added:
                               autoSpeakResponses (reads every App.Chat
                               reply aloud) and confirmationMode (auto
                               vs manual listening on Yes/No/Why
                               prompts). continuousListening — already
                               present as an inert future flag — is now
                               actually read by Bridge; its default
                               (false) is unchanged, so nothing turns on
                               for existing users automatically.
         App.Chat (extended, not replaced) — three small additive hooks
                               so a completely separate module (Voice)
                               can observe it without Chat knowing
                               anything about voice: onAIMessage()
                               (fires with every AI reply's text — used
                               to read it aloud), isOpen(), and an
                               optional {viaVoice:true} flag on
                               sendMessage() so a voice-started session
                               can remember its own origin. That origin
                               flag powers one new, small conversational
                               step: after a voice-originated income/
                               expense is saved, the assistant now asks
                               "Would you like to attach a photo of the
                               receipt?" (per the mission's example
                               flow) and opens the existing receipt
                               scanner if you say yes — reusing
                               App.OCR's already-existing scan zone,
                               nothing duplicated. Typed-chat behavior,
                               and every other transaction kind, is
                               unchanged.
         Voice Assistant tab  — the "Voice Engine (Foundation)" card is
                               now labelled "AI Voice Assistant
                               (Conversational)" and its mic button
                               starts a real, chat-connected
                               conversation (via Bridge) instead of the
                               previous inert single-shot preview — this
                               is exactly the "future sprint will wire
                               real intelligence into this" the
                               Foundation's own comments called for.
                               Three new settings rows (Auto-speak
                               responses, Continuous listening, Voice
                               confirmation mode) reuse the existing
                               .toggle-row/.switch styling already used
                               everywhere else in this tab — no new
                               visual language introduced.
         Chat panel (💬)      — one new 🎙️ button in the existing input
                               row starts/stops a hands-free voice
                               conversation using the same Bridge, so
                               voice is now available at the app's
                               single most-used conversational entry
                               point, not just a separate tab.
       Left untouched, per "never remove/redesign": the original Part
       2.3 quick single-shot voice-command panel (mic-fab / voiceOverlay
       — instant "add 200 for coffee" style commands, its own transcript
       parsing, its own history log) keeps working exactly as it did
       before this sprint; it now has one clarifying note pointing
       people to the new conversational assistant for multi-turn use.
       Offline-first: this sprint calls no network API — voice
       recognition/synthesis are the browser's built-in Web Speech API,
       exactly as before; everything voice logs still goes through
       App.Chat's real save*() functions and confirmation flow.
       Compatibility status: 100% backward compatible. No existing
       function, module, save*() call, storage key, or UI element was
       removed, renamed, or redesigned. Voice with "Continuous
       listening" left off (the default) behaves exactly like a single
       push-to-talk turn, same as before this sprint.
       Not in this sprint (left for a future pass): wake-word activation,
       offline/on-device recognition, multi-speaker handling, and a
       persisted transcript history for the new conversational assistant
       (it currently lives only in the existing chat log/session, same
       as typed chat).
       Ready for Sprint 20.

     Sprint 17 — Human-like AI Reasoning Layer (App.Chat extended, again)
       App version bumped: 1.15.0 -> 1.16.0
       Continues the same single conversation engine from Sprint 16
       (App.Chat) — no parallel reasoning system, no new namespace
       ceremony, nothing duplicated. Two earlier scaffolds already existed
       in this file under App.Conversation and App.Intent, explicitly
       commented as "architecture-only" placeholders never wired to
       anything real; this sprint deliberately does NOT add a third,
       similarly-unwired layer on top. Instead the "think before acting"
       behavior requested for this sprint was built directly into the
       one engine that already talks to the user and already saves data,
       so every piece below is real and reachable, not decorative:
         Reasoning trace + "Why?" — every value App.Chat fills in for you
                               (read from your message, defaulted from a
                               learned habit, or guessed) is now logged via
                               a small note() helper as it happens. At the
                               Yes/No confirmation step you can now also
                               reply "Why?" (or "kyun") and get back the
                               specific reasons, in plain language, instead
                               of a black-box guess — e.g. "Defaulted to
                               Food — it's the expense category you use
                               most often." Answering Why? does not consume
                               the confirmation; Yes/No/Why? all still work
                               afterward.
         Learned suggestions — App.Memory (built in an earlier sprint) was
                               already recording which categories/accounts/
                               modes you use most often for every saved
                               transaction, chat included, via its existing
                               saveTransactions() wrapper — but nothing was
                               ever reading that data back. App.Chat now
                               calls the existing App.Memory.Manager.suggest()
                               (unmodified) and, only when your message
                               itself doesn't specify a category or account,
                               offers your most-used one as the default —
                               same slot-filling flow, just a smarter empty
                               default. Refreshed on chat open and after
                               every save so it keeps learning. If
                               App.Memory is ever unavailable, this falls
                               back to exactly the pre-Sprint-17 behavior.
         Duplicate detection — before asking you to confirm an income or
                               expense, App.Chat now checks your existing
                               state.transactions for another entry with the
                               same type, date, amount, category and account,
                               and surfaces a ⚠️ warning inline in the
                               confirmation if one already exists — you still
                               decide whether to save it anyway.
         Unusual-amount warning — compares a new income/expense amount
                               against the average of your last ~30
                               transactions in that same category (once
                               there's enough history to compare against)
                               and flags anything more than 3x that average,
                               so a typo (150 -> 1500) gets caught before
                               saving instead of after.
         Chat-based undo, with an explicit warning — "undo last
                               transaction" (or "delete last entry", "pichla
                               wala hata do") now finds the most recently
                               logged transaction, describes exactly what it
                               is, and requires an explicit "yes, delete it"
                               before removing it via the EXISTING
                               state.transactions / saveTransactions() /
                               refreshChartsAndViews() — same single source
                               of truth as every other save/delete path in
                               this file. Kept in its own pendingUndo
                               variable, entirely separate from the existing
                               slot-filling `session` state machine, so it
                               cannot interfere with an in-progress income/
                               expense/etc. conversation.
       Compatibility status: 100% backward compatible. No existing
       function, module, save*() call, or UI element was removed, renamed,
       or redesigned. Every existing conversation kind (income / expense /
       transfer / savings / loan / investment / budget / goal / reminder)
       behaves exactly as it did in Sprint 16, plus the additions above.
       Not in this sprint (left for a future pass): editing/undoing an
       arbitrary (not-just-the-last) transaction by chat, voice-command
       parity for "why?"/undo (currently chat-only), and a persisted log
       of past reasoning traces (each trace currently lives only on its
       own session, per Sprint 16's existing session shape).
       Ready for Sprint 18.

     Sprint 16 — Human-like AI Finance Assistant, Phase 1 (App.Chat extended)
       App version bumped: 1.14.0 -> 1.15.0
       This sprint extends the REAL CONVERSATION ENGINE (App.Chat) built in
       an earlier sprint — it does NOT introduce a parallel/new chat system.
       App.Chat already did real slot-filling, human-style back-and-forth
       for income/expense/transfer/savings/loan/investment (ask → extract →
       confirm → save, Hindi/English/Hinglish, cancel/restart/session-
       timeout handling) — this sprint reuses that exact engine and adds:
         Budget conversations  — "set a budget for food" → asks category
                               (if missing) → asks the monthly limit →
                               confirms → saves via the EXISTING
                               state.budgets / saveBudgets() / renderBudgets()
                               (same data + same Budgets tab as the manual
                               form already used — single source of truth).
         Goal conversations    — "add a goal for a new phone" → asks what
                               it's for (if missing) → asks the target cost
                               → confirms → saves via the EXISTING
                               state.goals / saveGoals() / renderGoals(),
                               using the same goal object shape the manual
                               "Add a Goal" form already creates.
         Reminder conversations— "remind me to pay rent" → asks what to
                               remind about → asks the date → confirms →
                               saves. Reminders had no storage before this
                               sprint, so one small additive slice was added
                               following the exact existing pattern of every
                               other module: state.reminders (new array,
                               alongside the existing state.* fields),
                               saveReminders() (mirrors saveBudgets()/
                               saveGoals() — same localStorage convention,
                               key "khaata:reminders"), loaded in the
                               existing loadState(), and included in the
                               existing "clear all data" reset. No new UI
                               screen was added (per "never redesign the
                               UI") — reminders are created and will be
                               read back through the chat assistant itself.
         Resume interrupted conversations — reopening the chat panel
                               mid-flow (or after a page reload, since the
                               session was already being persisted to
                               localStorage before this sprint) now greets
                               the user with "Welcome back — picking up
                               where we left off" and automatically re-asks
                               the exact pending question or confirmation,
                               instead of silently sitting on a half-filled
                               draft. Uses the existing session persistence
                               and the existing SESSION_TIMEOUT_MS idle
                               window — a session older than that is left
                               to the existing timeout-reset behavior.
         General Finance Questions — already handled by the App.OnlineAI
                               hook wired into App.Chat in an earlier
                               sprint; this sprint made no changes there,
                               and confirmed it still works unmodified.
       Every new "kind" (budget / goal / reminder) reuses the exact same
       shared machinery every existing kind already used — classifyKind(),
       nextMissingStep(), questionFor(), buildSummaryText(), saveDraft(),
       applyAnswerToStep(), applyFreeformEdit(), isYes()/isNo()/isCancel()/
       isRestart() — nothing was duplicated into a separate code path.
       Compatibility status: 100% backward compatible. No existing function,
       module, save*() call, or UI element was removed, renamed, or
       redesigned. Income/expense/transfer/savings/loan/investment
       conversations behave exactly as before.
       Not in this sprint (kept for a future pass, per the "one sprint at a
       time" plan): dedicated Reminders UI tab / browser notifications,
       multi-turn correction of already-confirmed answers ("wrong answer"
       handling beyond what App.Chat already did), and voice-command
       parity for budget/goal/reminder (currently chat-only; Part 2.3 voice
       assistant untouched).
       Ready for Sprint 17.

     Sprint 15 — Online AI Knowledge Engine (App.OnlineAI)
       App version bumped: 1.13.0 -> 1.14.0
       Added (fully implemented, real code, not placeholders), all additive —
       nothing from Sprint 1-14 was removed, redesigned, or renamed:
         App.OnlineAI          — new namespace. Submodules: Config, Logger,
                               DecisionEngine, Knowledge, SourceManager,
                               Cache, Search, Sync, Manager (all 9
                               modules requested).
         App.OnlineAI.DecisionEngine — classifies any message that isn't
                               a transaction to log into one of: tax,
                               stock, mutualFund, goldSilver, crypto,
                               govtScheme, investment, finance, or
                               generalKnowledge — or null if it isn't a
                               question at all (existing transaction
                               flow is untouched in that case).
         App.OnlineAI.Knowledge — offline, no-network FAQ answers for
                               common finance terms (SIP, PPF, ELSS, NPS,
                               EMI, compound interest, credit score,
                               emergency fund, 80C, FD) — tried first,
                               before anything online (offline-first).
         App.OnlineAI.Search    — real, working, key-less online lookups:
                               Wikipedia REST API for general knowledge,
                               CoinGecko public API for live crypto
                               prices — both free, no API key. For
                               categories with no reliable key-less
                               live-data API (stock price, mutual fund
                               NAV, gold/silver rate, tax slabs, govt
                               schemes) it never invents a number —
                               it returns trusted official sources to
                               check instead (NSE/BSE, AMFI, Income Tax
                               Dept., IBJA, MyScheme, RBI, SEBI).
         App.OnlineAI.SourceManager — attaches source name, website,
                               published date (if known), last-updated
                               timestamp and confidence level to every
                               online answer.
         App.OnlineAI.Cache     — localStorage cache of recent online
                               answers, per-category TTL (5 min for
                               crypto, 7 days for general knowledge),
                               auto-trimmed, so repeat questions don't
                               re-search.
         App.OnlineAI.Sync      — architecture-ready hook: mirrors
                               App.Memory.Manager.backupPrepare()'s
                               pattern so a future sprint can fold this
                               cache into the Drive backup, plus a
                               provider registry so more online sources
                               can be added later without Search/Manager
                               changing shape (multi-provider ready).
         App.OnlineAI.Manager   — offline-first façade: Knowledge, then
                               Cache, then live Search, in that order.
                               Wired into App.Chat.startFlowFromMessage
                               as one small additive branch — only
                               takes over when a message does NOT look
                               like a transaction AND DOES look like a
                               knowledge question; the income/expense/
                               transfer/savings/loan/investment
                               slot-filling flow is completely untouched.
       No API keys, no paid services, no cloud account dependency —
       Wikipedia and CoinGecko are free, key-less, CORS-enabled public
       endpoints; everything else is either 100% offline or an honest
       "here's the trusted source" reference answer.
       Compatibility status: 100% backward compatible. No existing
       function, module, save*() call, or UI element was removed,
       renamed, or redesigned.
       Ready for Sprint 16.

     Sprint 14 — AI Reports & Smart Analytics Engine (App.Reports, App.Analytics)
       App version bumped: 1.12.0 -> 1.13.0
       Added (fully implemented, real code, not placeholders), all additive —
       nothing from Sprint 1-13 was removed, redesigned, or renamed:
         App.Reports        — new namespace. Submodules: Config, Logger,
                               Filter, Builder, Analytics, Export, Share,
                               Manager.
         App.Reports.Filter    — one filter model (period + date range +
                               category/subcategory/account/mode/merchant/
                               tag/min-max amount/transaction type) shared
                               by every report focus below.
         App.Reports.Builder   — builds the 18 report types requested:
                               Daily/Weekly/Monthly/Yearly/Custom (period
                               presets) crossed with 13 "focus" views —
                               Overview, Category, Subcategory, Income,
                               Expense, Cash Flow, Savings, Loan, Investment,
                               Budget, Account, Payment Method, Merchant —
                               each reading only state already in memory.
         App.Reports.Analytics — delegates to App.Analytics (below) and
                               renders the result as the plain-language
                               "Smart AI Insights" list on the new tab.
         App.Reports.Export    — real, working CSV / JSON / Excel(.xls)
                               / Print-to-PDF / on-screen printable exports
                               of whatever report is currently on screen.
         App.Reports.Share     — Web Share API with a clipboard-copy
                               fallback, for the same report summary.
         App.Reports.Manager   — orchestrates the above + reuses the
                               Sprint-13 auto-update pattern (wraps the
                               same save*() functions again) so the new
                               Reports tab refreshes itself the moment any
                               transaction/budget/account/etc. changes,
                               with zero manual reload — but only does any
                               work while the Reports tab is the one on
                               screen (same isActive + debounce + rAF
                               batching approach as App.Dashboard.Manager).
         App.Analytics       — new namespace, offline rule-based
                               "AI insights" engine, separate from and
                               additive to App.Dashboard.Analytics (which
                               is untouched and still powers the Home tab).
         App.Analytics.Insights — generates the specific plain-language
                               insights requested (income up/down, food
                               higher than usual, travel trend, most-used
                               payment method by amount and by count,
                               savings trend, cash balance trend, budget
                               exceeded, top expense category, top income
                               source, most active account, forecast
                               headline) — written so a 10-year-old,
                               a first-time user, or a professional
                               accountant can all read the same sentence.
         App.Analytics.Trends    — month-over-month direction/slope helper
                               used by Insights (e.g. "Travel expenses are
                               increasing" needs 3+ months of direction,
                               not just a single delta).
         App.Analytics.Forecast  — simple, clearly-labeled ESTIMATE
                               projection (trailing-average based) for
                               next month's income/expense/top category —
                               no external AI model, no network call.
         App.Analytics.Manager   — thin orchestrator wiring the three
                               above together for App.Reports.Analytics.
       New tab: "AI Reports" (top tabs + bottom-nav "More" sheet) —
         id="view-reports" — sits alongside (not instead of) the existing
         "Monthly Report" and "Insights" tabs, which are byte-for-byte
         unchanged.
       Compatibility: 100% additive. No existing function signature,
         markup id/class, storage key, or tab was removed, renamed or
         redesigned. All new work reads state that already exists; it
         does not add new persisted fields to state or localStorage.
       Explicitly NOT implemented per instructions: cloud sync, any
         online/API-based AI, stock-market APIs, tax APIs, internet
         search. Every report/insight/forecast here is 100% offline,
         computed only from data already on this device.
     ================================================================
     Sprint 13 — Intelligent AI Dashboard (App.Dashboard) + Performance Pass
       App version bumped: 1.11.0 -> 1.12.0
       Added (fully implemented, real code, not placeholders):
         App.Dashboard, .Config, .Logger, .Manager, .Cards, .Analytics,
         .Widgets, .QuickActions, .RecentActivity, .Charts
           — The Home tab is now a real "Smart Dashboard": today's
           income/expense/balance, monthly income/expense/savings, a
           Cash / Bank / Wallet balance breakdown (grouped from your
           existing accounts by type), Recent Transactions, Upcoming
           Bills (from Recurring), Budget Status, Loan Summary (from
           Debts & Loans), Investment Summary, Goal Progress, Quick Add
           buttons (reuse the existing FAB sheet — no new entry path),
           and a Recent Activity feed (last AI chat exchange, last OCR
           scan, most recent attachment) pulled from the existing
           App.Chat / App.OCR / App.Attachments modules.
           Everything already on the Home tab (Safe-to-Spend card,
           hero KPIs, "See full breakdown" panel, charts) is untouched
           and still renders exactly as before — the Smart Dashboard is
           additive, inserted as a new section on the same tab.
         App.Dashboard.Analytics — a small set of offline, rule-based
           insights computed from your own recorded data only (e.g.
           food spend vs last week, this month's savings vs last
           month, top category, low cash balance, a budget close to
           its limit). No network call, no external AI model — this is
           pattern-matching over `state`, written so a future sprint
           can plug in a smarter engine behind the same
           App.Dashboard.Analytics.generate() call without changing
           anything that calls it.
         Auto-update engine — adding, editing, deleting, duplicating,
           undoing, CSV-importing or JSON-restoring a transaction (and
           editing budgets/accounts/goals/debts/credit cards/
           investments/recurring rules) now refreshes the dashboard
           with no manual reload. This wraps the existing save*()
           functions (saveTransactions, saveAccounts, saveBudgets, …)
           once, in one place, instead of editing every call site —
           the functions themselves are unchanged, still do exactly
           what they did before, and still work if called directly.
           Refreshes are debounced and only actually touch the DOM
           when the Home tab is the one currently on screen, so
           importing 500 rows doesn't redraw the dashboard 500 times
           and switching tabs elsewhere doesn't pay any dashboard-
           render cost at all.
       Performance (scoped, honestly reported — see App.Dashboard.Config
       comment near the end of the file for specifics):
         Added App.Utils.debounce / App.Utils.throttle (general-purpose,
           available to any future module).
         Dashboard refreshes are batched with requestAnimationFrame so
           several rapid state changes in the same tick collapse into
           one render instead of one per change.
         The dashboard's own aggregate math (today/month totals,
           category sums) is computed once per refresh in
           App.Dashboard.Cards and passed to Widgets/Analytics, rather
           than each widget re-scanning `state.transactions` on its
           own.
         Dashboard widgets that need attachment/OCR data are rendered
           after the synchronous parts of the dashboard, matching the
           pattern already used for attachment counts in
           renderTransactions() — a slow IndexedDB read never blocks
           the rest of the dashboard.
         This sprint did not rewrite or re-profile the app's other
           ~30 view renderers, the existing chart/IndexedDB code, or
           the OCR/Voice/Attachments engines — that was out of scope
           for "build the Dashboard" and isn't claimed here.
       Nothing existing was removed, renamed, or redesigned. See the
       "SMART DASHBOARD" comment block near the end of the <script>
       for full module docs.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------
     Sprint 12 — Production OCR Engine (App.OCR) + Intelligent Auto-Save
     Engine (App.AutoSave)
       App version bumped: 1.10.0 -> 1.11.0
       Added (fully implemented, real code, not placeholders):
         App.OCR, .Scanner, .Parser, .Validator, .Logger, .UI
           — Real, working OCR via Tesseract.js (loaded lazily from a
           CDN only when the user taps "Scan Receipt / Bill", so
           startup weight/perf is unaffected). Reads receipts, bills,
           invoices, GST bills, bank slips, and payment/UPI screenshots.
           Handwriting recognition uses the same pipeline but is
           genuinely low-accuracy with the lightweight model this runs
           client-side — exposed as an explicit "experimental" mode
           rather than a false promise of production accuracy, matching
           Tesseract's real-world limits on cursive/handwritten input.
         App.AutoSave, .Manager, .Queue, .Sync, .Recovery
           — Debounced, deduped save queue + crash/refresh recovery for
           in-progress work (the New Transaction form and any open OCR
           review draft) that previously had no recovery if the tab
           closed mid-edit. Note: committed data (transactions, budgets,
           accounts, etc.) already auto-saved to localStorage on every
           change with no Save button anywhere in the app before this
           sprint — that behavior is unchanged and is not re-implemented
           here, only extended to cover *uncommitted* in-progress drafts.
         Google Drive auth is untouched and already did the right thing:
           one consent prompt, cached token reused silently until near
           expiry (see driveEnsureToken()), silent refresh afterwards.
           App.AutoSave.Sync simply calls the existing debounced
           driveMaybeAutoBackup() after a queue flush instead of
           duplicating any auth logic.
       See the "PRODUCTION OCR ENGINE" and "INTELLIGENT AUTO-SAVE ENGINE"
       comment blocks near the end of the <script> for full module docs.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------
     Sprint 11 — Smart Attachment Engine (App.Attachments)
       App version bumped: 1.9.0 -> 1.10.0
       Added (fully implemented, real code, not placeholders):
         App.Attachments, .Config, .Logger, .Security, .Validator,
         .Compression, .Storage, .Cache, .Manager, .Viewer, .UI
       See the "SMART ATTACHMENT ENGINE" comment block near the end of
       the <script> for full module docs and the change log entry
       below duplicated in-context.
     ================================================================== -->

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.4/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script>
<script src="https://apis.google.com/js/api.js" async defer></script>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

:root{
  --ink:#12203A;
  --ink-soft:#3A4A68;
  --paper:#F6F3EC;
  --paper-raised:#FFFFFF;
  --line:#DAD3C3;
  --gold:#B98A1E;
  --gold-soft:#F1E4C0;
  --teal:#0E7C6B;
  --teal-soft:#DDEEE9;
  --rust:#B54834;
  --rust-soft:#F5E1DB;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(18,32,58,0.06), 0 8px 24px rgba(18,32,58,0.05);
  --radius: 14px;
  --font-display:'Fraunces', serif;
  --font-body:'Inter', sans-serif;
  --font-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
}
[data-theme="dark"]{
  --ink:#EDE7D9;
  --ink-soft:#B8B0A0;
  --paper:#161B22;
  --paper-raised:#1E2530;
  --line:#323B49;
  --gold:#E0B144;
  --gold-soft:#33291A;
  --teal:#3FCBAE;
  --teal-soft:#132723;
  --rust:#E38069;
  --rust-soft:#2B1D1B;
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body);transition:background .25s ease,color .25s ease;}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 20px 80px;}

/* Header */
.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:6px 0 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;}
.brand-mark{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:.2px;}
.brand-sub{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;}
.topbar-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}
.icon-btn{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;width:38px;height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);}
.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}

/* Tabs */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:22px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.tab{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:.15s;}
.tab.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--ink);}
[data-theme="dark"] .tab.active{background:var(--gold);color:#161B22;border-color:var(--gold);}

.view{display:none;}
.view.active{display:block;animation:fade .25s ease;}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

/* Cards */
.card{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:20px;}
.card + .card{margin-top:16px;}
.card-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.card-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;}
.card-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);}

/* KPI grid */
.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.kpi{position:relative;background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;}
/* Sprint 33 — "Full Breakdown" premium redesign. Scoped to
   #dashDetailsPanel only (Stripe-Analytics-meets-Apple-Dashboard
   look) — the bare .kpi/.kpi-grid rules just above stay as a
   generic fallback for any other reuse elsewhere and are untouched. */
#dashBreakdownWrap{background:var(--kh-bg1);border-radius:26px;padding:20px 16px 22px;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-bd-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:2px 4px 16px;}
.kh-bd-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.2px;color:var(--kh-text);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.kh-bd-title::before{content:'';width:7px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(124,58,237,.6);}
#dashDetailsToggle.kh-bd-toggle{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);color:var(--kh-cyan);font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s var(--kh-ease-spring,ease),border-color .15s;}
#dashDetailsToggle.kh-bd-toggle:hover{border-color:var(--kh-purple2);transform:translateY(-1px);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px;}
@media(min-width:640px){.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
@media(min-width:980px){.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
.kpi.kh-bd-card{
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card) 65%);
  border:1px solid transparent;
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:18px 16px 16px;
  box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04) inset, 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  overflow:visible;
  isolation:isolate;
  transition:transform .22s var(--kh-ease-spring,ease), box-shadow .22s ease;
  animation:khBdIn .5s var(--kh-ease-out,ease) backwards;
}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.02s;--ca:var(--kh-bd1a);--cb:var(--kh-bd1b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.05s;--ca:var(--kh-bd2a);--cb:var(--kh-bd2b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.08s;--ca:var(--kh-bd3a);--cb:var(--kh-bd3b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.11s;--ca:var(--kh-bd4a);--cb:var(--kh-bd4b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.14s;--ca:var(--kh-bd5a);--cb:var(--kh-bd5b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.17s;--ca:var(--kh-bd6a);--cb:var(--kh-bd6b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.20s;--ca:var(--kh-bd7a);--cb:var(--kh-bd7b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.23s;--ca:var(--kh-bd8a);--cb:var(--kh-bd8b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(9){animation-delay:.26s;--ca:var(--kh-bd1a);--cb:var(--kh-bd1b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(10){animation-delay:.29s;--ca:var(--kh-bd2a);--cb:var(--kh-bd2b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(11){animation-delay:.32s;--ca:var(--kh-bd3a);--cb:var(--kh-bd3b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(12){animation-delay:.35s;--ca:var(--kh-bd4a);--cb:var(--kh-bd4b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(13){animation-delay:.38s;--ca:var(--kh-bd5a);--cb:var(--kh-bd5b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(14){animation-delay:.41s;--ca:var(--kh-bd6a);--cb:var(--kh-bd6b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(15){animation-delay:.44s;--ca:var(--kh-bd7a);--cb:var(--kh-bd7b);}
.kpi-grid.kh-bd-grid .kpi.kh-bd-card:nth-child(16){animation-delay:.47s;--ca:var(--kh-bd8a);--cb:var(--kh-bd8b);}
.kpi.kh-bd-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:22px;padding:1px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ca),transparent 60%);-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;pointer-events:none;opacity:.7;}
.kpi.kh-bd-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-30px;right:-30px;width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ca);filter:blur(38px);opacity:.28;z-index:-1;transition:opacity .25s ease;}
.kpi.kh-bd-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset, 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
.kpi.kh-bd-card:hover::after{opacity:.5;}
.kh-bd-ic{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ca),var(--cb));box-shadow:0 6px 16px -4px var(--ca);flex-shrink:0;}
.kpi.kh-bd-card .kpi-label{font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.1px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;}
.kpi.kh-bd-card .kpi-value{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:21px;margin-top:5px;color:var(--kh-text);letter-spacing:-.3px;}
.kpi.kh-bd-card .kpi-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;}
@keyframes khBdIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px) scale(.97);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}}
.chart-grid.kh-bd-charts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}
@media(min-width:769px){.chart-grid.kh-bd-charts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
.chart-grid.kh-bd-charts .chart-box{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card) 70%);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:22px;padding:16px 14px;box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
.chart-grid.kh-bd-charts .chart-box h4{color:var(--kh-text);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px;margin:0 0 10px;}
.chart-grid.kh-bd-charts .chart-box canvas{max-height:220px;}
.kpi::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:4px;background:var(--accent,var(--gold));}
.kpi-label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;}
.kpi-value{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:600;font-size:23px;margin-top:6px;}
.kpi-sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:4px;}
.kpi.income{--accent:var(--teal);}
.kpi.expense{--accent:var(--rust);}
.kpi.savings{--accent:var(--gold);}

/* Charts grid */
.chart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:16px;}
.chart-box{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px;}
.chart-box h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;}
.chart-box canvas{max-height:230px;}
.empty-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;padding:20px 4px;}

/* Forms */
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;}
label{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;display:block;margin-bottom:5px;}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:9px 11px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:13.5px;}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--gold);}
.btn{font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;}
.btn:hover{opacity:.88;}
.btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line);}
.btn.small{padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:7px;}
.btn.teal{background:var(--teal);border-color:var(--teal);color:#fff;}
.btn.rust{background:var(--rust);border-color:var(--rust);color:#fff;}
.row-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;}

/* Table */
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;min-width:680px;}
th{text-align:left;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
td{padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);vertical-align:middle;}
tr:hover td{background:var(--paper);}
.amt-in{color:var(--teal);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:600;}
.amt-ex{color:var(--rust);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:600;}
.tag{font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
.tbl-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;}
.tbl-actions button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;width:26px;height:26px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px;}
.tbl-actions button:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);}

/* filters */
.filters{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px;align-items:flex-end;}
.filters > div{min-width:140px;}

/* budget bars */
.budget-row{margin-bottom:14px;}
.budget-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:5px;}
.budget-cat{font-weight:600;}
.budget-figs{font-family:var(--font-mono);color:var(--ink-soft);}
.bar-track{height:9px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;}
.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:var(--teal);}
.bar-fill.over{background:var(--rust);}
.bar-fill.warn{background:var(--gold);}

/* insight list */
.insight{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.insight:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.insight .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;margin-top:6px;flex:none;}
.insight p{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;}
.insight .dot.good{background:var(--teal);}
.insight .dot.warn{background:var(--gold);}
.insight .dot.bad{background:var(--rust);}
.insight .dot.info{background:var(--ink-soft);}

/* toggle group */
.seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;}
.seg button{border:none;background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink-soft);padding:8px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.seg button.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}
[data-theme="dark"] .seg button.active{background:var(--gold);color:#161B22;}

.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:16px;}
@media(max-width:820px){.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

.foot-note{text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:11.5px;margin-top:30px;font-family:var(--font-mono);}
.badge-count{background:var(--rust);color:#fff;border-radius:99px;font-size:10px;padding:1px 6px;margin-left:5px;}
.hidden{display:none!important;}
.save-flash{position:fixed;bottom:18px;right:18px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12.5px;font-family:var(--font-mono);box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:.25s;pointer-events:none;z-index:50;}
[data-theme="dark"] .save-flash{background:var(--gold);color:#161B22;}
.save-flash.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
/* App.Advisor proactive toast — Sprint 20. Same visual language as
   .save-flash above (reused tokens, not a new design system), just
   wider (to fit a short warning sentence) and positioned above it so
   the two never overlap when both fire close together. */
.advisor-toast{position:fixed;bottom:56px;right:18px;left:18px;max-width:360px;margin-left:auto;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:11px 14px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12.5px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:.25s;pointer-events:none;z-index:51;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);}
[data-theme="dark"] .advisor-toast{background:#161B22;color:var(--ink);border-left-color:var(--gold);}
.advisor-toast.bad{border-left-color:var(--rust);}
.advisor-toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.advisor-reco{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.advisor-reco:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.advisor-reco p{flex:1;margin:0;font-size:13px;}
.advisor-reco .link-btn{white-space:nowrap;}

/* ===================================================================
   KHAATA 2.0 — additive styles
=================================================================== */

/* Global search */
.gsearch-wrap{position:relative;flex:1;max-width:420px;}
.gsearch-input{padding:8px 12px 8px 32px!important;font-size:13px!important;}
.gsearch-icon{position:absolute;left:10px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);pointer-events:none;}
@media(max-width:768px){.gsearch-wrap{display:none;}}

/* Dashboard 2.0 */
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.hero-card{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px 16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.hero-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:4px;background:var(--accent,var(--gold));}
.hero-card .hl{font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;}
.hero-card .hv{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:21px;margin-top:5px;}
.hero-card .hs{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:3px;}
.hero-card.big{grid-column:span 2;}
@media(max-width:480px){.hero-card.big{grid-column:span 2;}}

/* ---- Smart Dashboard (App.Dashboard) — reuses .card/.kpi/.insight/
   .budget-row/.bar-track tokens above; these are the few net-new,
   additive classes it needs. ---- */
.dash-section{margin-bottom:16px;}
.dash-section-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.dash-quickgrid{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:16px;}
.dash-quickgrid button{flex:1;min-width:104px;padding:12px 8px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;}
.dash-quickgrid button:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}
.dash-quickgrid button .qi-ic{font-size:17px;}
.widget-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:14px;}
.widget-box{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px;}
.widget-box h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;}
.widget-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;}
.widget-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;}
.widget-row .wr-label{color:var(--ink-soft);}
.widget-row .wr-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;}
.activity-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);font-size:12.5px;}
.activity-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.activity-ic{flex:none;}
.activity-body p{margin:0;line-height:1.45;}
.activity-meta{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:10.5px;margin-top:2px;}

.sts-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal-soft),var(--paper-raised));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:18px;margin-bottom:14px;}
[data-theme="dark"] .sts-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#132723,#1E2530);}
.sts-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.sts-label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:700;}
.sts-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:30px;color:var(--teal);}
.sts-amt.over{color:var(--rust);}
.sts-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;}
.sts-bar{height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;margin-top:10px;}
.sts-bar-fill{height:100%;background:var(--teal);border-radius:99px;}
.sts-bar-fill.over{background:var(--rust);}
.sts-warn{margin-top:10px;font-size:12.5px;background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;}
.sts-disclaimer{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:10px;}

.link-btn{background:none;border:none;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;padding:0;text-decoration:underline;}
.details-panel{margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}

/* FAB + Quick Add */
.fab{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:86px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);color:#161B22;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;border:none;box-shadow:var(--shadow);cursor:pointer;z-index:60;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:0;}
[data-theme="light"] .fab{color:#fff;}
@media(min-width:769px){.fab{bottom:28px;}}
/* Sprint 24 — Home Screen: Scan FAB (repurposed from the old
   chat-fab button element — see build log). Left slot, same size
   family as + so all three FABs read as one action row. */
.scan-fab{position:fixed;left:18px;bottom:86px;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;font-size:24px;border:none;box-shadow:var(--shadow);cursor:pointer;z-index:60;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:0;transition:.15s;}
.scan-fab.hidden{display:none!important;}
@media(min-width:769px){.scan-fab{bottom:28px;}}
@media(max-width:768px){.scan-fab{bottom:78px;}}

/* Sprint 29 — Premium FAB Consolidation (superseded in part by
   Sprint 30 below, which splits mic back out of the "+" menu into
   its own standalone button — see Sprint 30 build-log note).
   Camera FAB removed from view entirely. */
.scan-fab{display:none!important;}

@keyframes khFabPulse{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(124,58,237,.55),0 0 0 6px rgba(124,58,237,.14);}
  50%{box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(124,58,237,.75),0 0 0 11px rgba(124,58,237,.06);}
}
@keyframes khMicPulse{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(20,241,217,.4),0 0 0 6px rgba(124,58,237,.14);}
  50%{box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(20,241,217,.6),0 0 0 11px rgba(20,241,217,.08);}
}

/* Sprint 30 — "+" now sits bottom-right, just above the More tab
   (not centered), and only opens the two-item plus-menu below. */
.kh-fab-trigger{
  left:auto;right:18px;transform:none;
  bottom:96px;width:58px;height:58px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C3AED 0%,#9F5FFF 100%);
  color:#fff;font-weight:400;font-size:28px;
  animation:khFabPulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1),box-shadow .35s;
  z-index:64;
}
.kh-fab-trigger.kh-open{transform:rotate(45deg);animation:none;box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(124,58,237,.75),0 0 0 8px rgba(124,58,237,.2);}
@media(min-width:769px){.kh-fab-trigger{bottom:30px;right:26px;}}
@media(max-width:768px){.kh-fab-trigger{bottom:82px;right:16px;}}

/* Sprint 30 — mic is a standalone always-visible FAB, bottom-left,
   just above the Home tab. Same #micFabBtn element/handler as every
   prior sprint; only its position/visibility CSS changed here. */
.mic-fab{
  left:18px;right:auto;transform:none;
  bottom:96px;width:58px;height:58px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C3AED 0%,#14F1D9 100%);
  opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;
  animation:khMicPulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  transition:transform .2s,opacity .25s;
  z-index:64;
}
.mic-fab:active{transform:scale(.92);}
.mic-fab.listening{background:var(--rust);animation:none;}
@media(min-width:769px){.mic-fab{bottom:30px;left:26px;}}
@media(max-width:768px){.mic-fab{bottom:82px;left:16px;}}

/* Sprint 30 — permanent label under the mic FAB ("Voice Assistant"),
   and a label under the "+" that hides once its menu is open (the
   open menu already carries its own item labels). */
.kh-fab-tag{
  position:fixed;bottom:66px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-text-soft);
  letter-spacing:.2px;pointer-events:none;z-index:64;text-align:center;width:76px;
  text-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.6);transition:opacity .2s;
}
#khMicTag{left:-9px;}
#khPlusTag{right:-9px;}
@media(min-width:769px){.kh-fab-tag{bottom:6px;}}
.kh-fab-tag.kh-hide{opacity:0;}

/* Sprint 30 — the "+" now expands a small glass menu with exactly two
   premium items (Manual Entry, Camera / Upload), replacing the old
   single-item mic reveal. Anchored above the "+" on the right. */
.kh-plus-menu{
  position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:158px;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translateY(14px) scale(.92);
  transform-origin:bottom right;
  transition:opacity .28s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1),transform .28s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);
  z-index:64;
}
.kh-plus-menu.kh-open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
@media(min-width:769px){.kh-plus-menu{bottom:96px;right:26px;}}
.kh-plus-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  background:rgba(13,18,38,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(140%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(140%);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:16px;
  padding:10px 16px 10px 10px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;
  box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-pop);
  transition:transform .15s var(--kh-ease-spring),border-color .15s;
}
.kh-plus-item:hover{border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.5);}
.kh-plus-item:active{transform:scale(.96);}
.kh-plus-item .kh-plus-ic{
  width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:11px;flex-shrink:0;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));color:#fff;
  box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(124,58,237,.4);
}
.kh-plus-item .kh-plus-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.kh-plus-item .kh-plus-title{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;}
.kh-plus-item .kh-plus-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:1px;}

.kh-fab-backdrop{
  position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(5,7,15,.4);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .25s;z-index:58;
}
.kh-fab-backdrop.kh-open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;}

/* Sprint 33 — Home Screen must show exactly ONE floating button (the
   Voice Assistant mic). The "+" (#fabBtn) and its label/menu are now
   hidden everywhere by default and only reveal themselves — as a
   floating glass button in the top-right corner — while the More
   sheet (#moreSheetOverlay) is open. body.kh-more-open is toggled by
   the existing moreNavBtn/moreSheetClose handlers; #fabBtn, its
   click handler, #khPlusMenu (Manual Entry / Camera & Upload) and
   the Camera/Gallery/PDF sheet are all completely unchanged — only
   *when* and *where* the "+" is visible has changed. */
#fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger, #khPlusTag{display:none!important;}
body.kh-more-open #fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger{
  display:flex!important;
  top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 16px);right:16px;bottom:auto;left:auto;
  width:50px;height:50px;font-size:24px;
  z-index:80;
  box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(124,58,237,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);
}
body.kh-more-open #khPlusTag{
  display:block!important;
  top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 68px);right:8px;bottom:auto;left:auto;
}
body.kh-more-open .kh-plus-menu{top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 78px);bottom:auto;right:16px;transform-origin:top right;}
body.kh-more-open .kh-plus-menu.kh-open{transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
body:not(.kh-more-open) .kh-plus-menu{opacity:0!important;pointer-events:none!important;}

/* Sprint 30 — subtle "lift" press feedback across Home-screen cards
   and buttons, CSS-only, no JS/markup change. */
.kh-qa-btn:active .kh-qa-ic{transform:scale(.88);}
.kh-stat-card:active,
.kh-section:active,
.kh-txn-row:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(.985);}
.kh-stat-card,.kh-section{transition:transform .16s var(--kh-ease-spring),border-color .16s;}
.kh-txn-row{transition:transform .16s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh-qa-ic{transition:transform .18s var(--kh-ease-spring);}

.sheet-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(18,32,58,.45);z-index:70;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;}
.sheet-overlay.hidden{display:none;}
.sheet{background:var(--paper);width:100%;max-width:520px;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;padding:18px 18px 26px;max-height:86vh;overflow-y:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
@media(min-width:769px){.sheet-overlay{align-items:center;}.sheet{border-radius:16px;max-width:440px;}}
.sheet-handle{width:40px;height:4px;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;margin:0 auto 14px;}
.sheet-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.qa-types{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.qa-types button{flex:1;padding:12px 6px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);}
.qa-types button.active{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--ink);}
[data-theme="dark"] .qa-types button.active{background:var(--gold);color:#161B22;}
.qa-amounts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.qa-amounts button{padding:14px 4px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);}
.qa-amounts button:active,.qa-amounts button.picked{background:var(--gold-soft);border-color:var(--gold);}
.qa-close{position:absolute;top:14px;right:16px;background:none;border:none;font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;}
/* Sprint 24 — Quick Entry sheet: additional entry types (Investment,
   Loan, Budget, Goal, Reminder). Reuses the same visual language as
   .more-item, kept in its own small class so the existing More menu
   grid is untouched. */
.qa-more-divider{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;text-align:center;margin:16px 0 10px;}
.qa-more-types{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px;}
.qa-more-types button{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 2px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}
.qa-more-types button .qi-ic{font-size:17px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}
.qa-more-types button.active{border-color:var(--gold);background:var(--gold-soft);}
@media(max-width:420px){.qa-more-types{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
.sheet{position:relative;}

/* Bottom mobile nav */
.bottom-nav{display:none;}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .bottom-nav{display:flex;position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:var(--paper-raised);border-top:1px solid var(--line);z-index:55;padding:4px 2px 6px;justify-content:space-around;box-shadow:0 -4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
  .bottom-nav button{flex:1;background:none;border:none;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:6px 2px;cursor:pointer;}
  .bottom-nav button .bn-ic{font-size:17px;}
  .bottom-nav button.active{color:var(--gold);}
  .wrap{padding-bottom:96px;}
  .tabs{display:none;}
  .fab{bottom:78px;}
}

/* More sheet */
.more-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;}
.more-item{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;}
.more-item .mi-ic{font-size:20px;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;}
.more-item:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}

/* Sprint 35 — More page: premium hero header + Featured Action card
   (top section only). Purely additive/visual — .more-grid, .more-item
   and every item below stay exactly as they were. The featured card
   below reuses the real .more-item element (data-view="entry") so
   the existing generic click-delegation handler still opens Add
   Entry; nothing new was wired in JS. Uses the app's fixed dark
   neon purple/cyan (--kh-*) tokens, same family as the Home-screen
   redesign, so it reads consistently regardless of the light/dark
   paper theme. */
.kh-more-hero{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  margin:-2px -2px 14px;padding:24px 20px 22px;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 140% at 14% -10%,rgba(124,58,237,.35),transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(120% 140% at 92% 118%,rgba(20,241,217,.28),transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06),rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%),
    var(--kh-bg1,#0B1020);
  border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line,rgba(255,255,255,.11));
  backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(150%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(150%);
  box-shadow:0 20px 46px -10px rgba(76,63,180,.45),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}
.kh-more-hero-title{
  font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:31px;letter-spacing:-.6px;line-height:1.1;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#D9CFFF 55%,#9BF3E8 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
}
.kh-more-hero-sub{margin-top:7px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.15px;color:rgba(247,247,251,.68);}

.more-item.kh-more-featured{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-align:left;
  padding:16px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,58,237,.22),rgba(20,241,217,.12));
  border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line,rgba(255,255,255,.14));
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(140%);
  box-shadow:0 16px 34px -8px rgba(76,63,180,.45),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  transition:transform .18s var(--kh-ease-spring,cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)),border-color .18s,box-shadow .18s;
}
.more-item.kh-more-featured:hover{border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.55);box-shadow:0 20px 42px -8px rgba(76,63,180,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
.more-item.kh-more-featured:active{transform:scale(.98);}
.kh-mf-ic{
  flex-shrink:0;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple,#7C3AED),var(--kh-cyan,#14F1D9));color:#fff;
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(124,58,237,.55),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset;
}
.kh-mf-txt{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;}
.kh-mf-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#F7F7FB;}
.kh-mf-sub{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(247,247,251,.6);}
.kh-mf-arrow{flex-shrink:0;font-size:18px;color:rgba(247,247,251,.75);transition:transform .18s var(--kh-ease-spring,ease);}
.more-item.kh-more-featured:hover .kh-mf-arrow{transform:translateX(3px);}

/* Sprint 35 — richer glow/hover-tap feel on the "+" FAB, only while
   it's showing in its More-page position; element, handler and every
   other state are untouched. */
body.kh-more-open #fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7C3AED 0%,#9F5FFF 55%,#14F1D9 140%);
  box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(124,58,237,.6),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.12) inset,0 0 24px rgba(20,241,217,.25);
  transition:transform .25s var(--kh-ease-spring,cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)),box-shadow .25s;
}
body.kh-more-open #fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger:hover{transform:scale(1.08);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(124,58,237,.7),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.16) inset,0 0 30px rgba(20,241,217,.35);}
body.kh-more-open #fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger:active{transform:scale(.92);}

@media(max-width:420px){
  .kh-more-hero{padding:20px 16px 18px;border-radius:20px;}
  .kh-more-hero-title{font-size:26px;}
  .more-item.kh-more-featured{padding:14px;gap:12px;border-radius:18px;}
  .kh-mf-ic{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;font-size:19px;}
}

/* Sprint 36 — More page: premium tool-card redesign, visible-area
   cards only (AI Assistant / Goals / Accounts / Recurring /
   Categories & Tags / Debts & Loans / Credit Cards / Investments /
   Cash Flow Forecast / Can I Spend This?). Purely additive/visual:
   every one of these 10 elements is still the exact same
   .more-item[id/data-view=...] node from .more-grid — the only HTML
   change is one extra class, "kh-tool-card", added alongside the
   existing "more-item" class so the generic .more-item
   click-delegation loop (and #moreAIAssistantItem's own listener)
   keep working with zero JS changes. The remaining 7 cards (Food
   Analysis, Monthly Report, AI Reports, AI Advisor, Search, Data &
   Backup, Voice Assistant) intentionally kept plain .more-item for a
   later step. Local #kh36-* colour tokens below match the requested
   palette (#070B16 / #141B2D / #7C4DFF / #00E5FF) without touching
   the shared --kh-purple/--kh-cyan/--kh-bg1 tokens Sprints 29-35
   already rely on elsewhere. */
.more-grid{gap:12px;}
.more-item.kh-tool-card{
  --kh36-purple:#7C4DFF;--kh36-cyan:#00E5FF;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;
  text-align:left;padding:16px 30px 16px 16px;border-radius:20px;min-height:92px;
  background:linear-gradient(155deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05),rgba(255,255,255,0) 45%),#141B2D;
  border:1px solid rgba(124,77,255,.22);
  box-shadow:0 10px 24px -10px rgba(3,5,14,.7),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  transition:transform .16s var(--kh-ease-spring,cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)),
             border-color .18s,box-shadow .18s,background .18s;
  animation:kh36In .4s var(--kh-ease-spring,ease) both;
}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.02s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.06s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.1s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.14s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.18s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.22s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.26s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.3s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(9){animation-delay:.34s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(10){animation-delay:.38s;}
@keyframes kh36In{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
.more-item.kh-tool-card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-2px) scale(1.015);
  border-color:rgba(124,77,255,.5);
  background:linear-gradient(155deg,rgba(255,255,255,.08),rgba(255,255,255,0) 45%),#161E33;
  box-shadow:0 14px 30px -10px rgba(124,77,255,.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.07);
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card:active{transform:scale(.97);}
/* Soft ripple-on-click: a radial highlight that blooms from center and
   fades — CSS-only, triggered on :active so it needs no JS hook. */
.more-item.kh-tool-card::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%,rgba(124,77,255,.35),transparent 60%);
  opacity:0;transform:scale(.4);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease;
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card:active::before{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);transition:opacity 0s,transform 0s;}
/* Tiny arrow indicator — decorative only, no markup added. */
.more-item.kh-tool-card::after{
  content:"→";position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
  color:rgba(247,247,251,.35);transition:transform .18s ease,color .18s ease;
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card:hover::after{transform:translateX(2px);color:rgba(0,229,255,.85);}
.more-item.kh-tool-card .mi-ic{
  position:relative;z-index:1;
  width:40px;height:40px;margin:0 0 12px;border-radius:13px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:19px;line-height:1;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,77,255,.28),rgba(0,229,255,.16));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 16px rgba(124,77,255,.35);
  animation:kh36Glow 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes kh36Glow{
  0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 14px rgba(124,77,255,.3);}
  50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset,0 0 20px rgba(0,229,255,.4);}
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#F0F0F7;letter-spacing:.1px;line-height:1.3;}
/* Gentle per-card glow-colour variety, purely cosmetic (cycles every
   3rd card) — icon chip only, doesn't affect layout or click areas. */
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(3n+2) .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,229,255,.22),rgba(124,77,255,.22));
}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(3n+3) .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,77,255,.3),rgba(124,77,255,.08));
}
@media(max-width:420px){
  .more-item.kh-tool-card{padding:14px 26px 14px 14px;min-height:84px;border-radius:18px;}
  .more-item.kh-tool-card .mi-ic{width:36px;height:36px;font-size:17px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px;}
}

/* Sprint 37 — More page: extends the exact same Sprint-36 kh-tool-card
   treatment to the remaining 7 cards (Food Analysis, Monthly Report,
   AI Reports, AI Advisor, Search, Data & Backup, Voice Assistant).
   Purely additive/visual, identical approach to Sprint 36: the only
   HTML change is adding the "kh-tool-card" class alongside the
   existing "more-item" class + untouched data-view — no id/class
   renamed, no JS touched, the generic .more-item click-delegation
   loop keeps working unchanged. All 17 cards now share one
   background/border/shadow/animation language (#141B2D card, same
   ripple + arrow + hover-lift) — only each icon chip's glow colour
   varies by category, targeted purely via existing data-view
   attribute selectors (no new markup):
     AI            (food, advisor)      -> default purple+cyan chip, unchanged
     Reports       (report, reports)    -> blue
     Search        (search)             -> sky blue
     Security/Backup (data)             -> orange
     Voice Assistant (voice)            -> teal
   Card size/padding/min-height stay identical to Sprint 36 — no
   unnecessary height increase. */
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(11){animation-delay:.42s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(12){animation-delay:.46s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(13){animation-delay:.5s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(14){animation-delay:.54s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(15){animation-delay:.58s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(16){animation-delay:.62s;}
.more-grid .more-item.kh-tool-card:nth-child(17){animation-delay:.66s;}

/* Category icon-glow accents — card background/border/shadow stay
   the shared kh-tool-card default; only .mi-ic changes. */
.more-item.kh-tool-card[data-view="report"] .mi-ic,
.more-item.kh-tool-card[data-view="reports"] .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(59,130,246,.32),rgba(96,165,250,.16));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 16px rgba(59,130,246,.4);
  animation:kh37GlowBlue 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card[data-view="search"] .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(14,165,233,.32),rgba(56,189,248,.16));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 16px rgba(14,165,233,.4);
  animation:kh37GlowSky 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card[data-view="data"] .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(249,115,22,.32),rgba(251,146,60,.16));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 16px rgba(249,115,22,.4);
  animation:kh37GlowOrange 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.more-item.kh-tool-card[data-view="voice"] .mi-ic{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(20,184,166,.32),rgba(45,212,191,.16));
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 16px rgba(20,184,166,.4);
  animation:kh37GlowTeal 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes kh37GlowBlue{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 14px rgba(59,130,246,.32);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset,0 0 20px rgba(96,165,250,.45);}}
@keyframes kh37GlowSky{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 14px rgba(14,165,233,.32);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset,0 0 20px rgba(56,189,248,.45);}}
@keyframes kh37GlowOrange{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 14px rgba(249,115,22,.32);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset,0 0 20px rgba(251,146,60,.45);}}
@keyframes kh37GlowTeal{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 0 14px rgba(20,184,166,.32);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset,0 0 20px rgba(45,212,191,.45);}}

/* Bottom padding so the last card (Voice Assistant) always clears
   the bottom nav / floating mic button when scrolled to the end.
   Scoped to this sheet only via its id, so #scanSheetOverlay and
   #quickAddOverlay's shared .sheet padding is untouched. */
#moreSheetOverlay .sheet{padding-bottom:44px;}

/* Accounts */
.acct-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;}
.acct-card{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px;position:relative;}
.acct-card.inactive{opacity:.5;}
.acct-ic{font-size:22px;}
.acct-name{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:6px;}
.acct-type{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.acct-bal{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:19px;margin-top:8px;}
.acct-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:10px;}

/* Transaction cards (mobile) */
.txn-cards{display:none;}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .table-wrap{display:none;}
  .txn-cards{display:block;}
}
.txn-card{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
.txn-card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;}
.txn-card-cat{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;}
.txn-card-sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.txn-card-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;white-space:nowrap;}
.txn-card-meta{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;}
.txn-card-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;}
.txn-card-actions button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;}
.chip{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;}
.chip.acct{background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal);}
.chip.tag{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);}

/* Search results */
.search-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.ss-box{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;text-align:center;}
.ss-box .ssv{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;}
.ss-box .ssl{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-top:2px;}

/* Recurring */
.recur-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.recur-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.recur-name{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;}
.recur-meta{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.upcoming-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);align-items:center;}
.upcoming-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}

/* Category manager */
.subcat-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;}
.subcat-pill{font-size:11px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink-soft);}
.subcat-pill.removable{padding-right:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.subcat-pill .pill-x{background:none;border:none;color:var(--rust);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:0 2px;line-height:1;}
.cat-block{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.cat-block .cat-x{background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;width:20px;height:20px;font-size:11px;color:var(--rust);cursor:pointer;margin-left:6px;}
.cat-block:last-child{border-bottom:none;}

/* Health score */
.score-ring-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.score-num{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:38px;}

/* Credit cards / status pills */
.status-pill{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:99px;}
.status-pill.good{background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal);}
.status-pill.warn{background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);}
.status-pill.bad{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);}
.cc-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.verdict-box{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px;text-align:center;}
.verdict-box.good{background:var(--teal-soft);}
.verdict-box.warn{background:var(--gold-soft);}
.verdict-box.bad{background:var(--rust-soft);}
.cc-history{display:none;margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}
.cc-history.open{display:block;}
.cc-hist-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:3px 0;}
.cc-toggle-link{background:none;border:none;color:var(--teal);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:0;margin-top:8px;}
.cc-estimate{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;}
.verdict-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .wrap{padding:14px 12px 90px;}
  .kpi-grid,.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .kpi-value,.hv{font-size:17px!important;}
  .brand-mark{font-size:21px;}
  .card{padding:15px;}
  .filters > div{min-width:47%;flex:1;}
  table{min-width:0;font-size:11.5px;}
}

/* ===================================================================
   TRANSACTIONS — MOBILE APP LOOK (requested redesign of the
   Transactions screen only, to match a reference screenshot).
   Everything below is scoped under .txn-mobiwrap / .txn-mobi-fab /
   #txnFiltersCard.open, so it never touches any other view or the
   app's own light/dark theme tokens. Desktop (>768px) is completely
   unaffected — it keeps the original filters+table experience.
   On mobile this replaces the old plain .txn-cards list; all
   existing edit/duplicate/delete/attachments/items functionality is
   reused as-is, just re-skinned (see renderTxnMobileList() in JS —
   it's added to the same [body, cardsWrap] event-wiring loop that
   already powers those actions, so nothing is duplicated).
=================================================================== */
.txn-mobiwrap{
  --tm-bg1:#0c0a1a; --tm-bg2:#181233;
  --tm-card:#1c1733; --tm-card-line:#2c2650;
  --tm-purple:#8b5cf6; --tm-purple-soft:rgba(139,92,246,.16);
  --tm-teal:#2dd9b9; --tm-teal-soft:rgba(45,217,185,.14);
  --tm-coral:#ff8a80; --tm-coral-soft:rgba(255,138,128,.14);
  --tm-text:#f1edff; --tm-text-soft:#9b93b8;
  display:none;
}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .txn-mobiwrap{display:block;}
  #view-transactions .txn-cards{display:none!important;}
  #txnFiltersCard{display:none;background:var(--tm-card);border-color:var(--tm-card-line);margin-top:12px;}
  #txnFiltersCard.open{display:block;}
}
.txn-mobiwrap{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--tm-bg2),var(--tm-bg1));border-radius:20px;padding:16px 14px 18px;color:var(--tm-text);}
.txn-mobi-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;}
.txn-mobi-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:var(--tm-purple);letter-spacing:.2px;}
.txn-mobi-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;}
.txn-mobi-icon-btn{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--tm-card-line);background:var(--tm-card);color:var(--tm-text);font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.txn-mobi-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.txn-mobi-sumcard{border-radius:16px;padding:14px;border:1px solid;overflow:hidden;}
.txn-mobi-sumcard.in{background:var(--tm-teal-soft);border-color:rgba(45,217,185,.35);}
.txn-mobi-sumcard.ex{background:var(--tm-coral-soft);border-color:rgba(255,138,128,.35);}
.tms-lbl{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.txn-mobi-sumcard.in .tms-lbl{color:var(--tm-teal);}
.txn-mobi-sumcard.ex .tms-lbl{color:var(--tm-coral);}
.tms-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;margin-top:8px;color:var(--tm-text);}
.txn-mobi-pills{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:16px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.txn-mobi-pills .txn-pill{white-space:nowrap;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--tm-card-line);background:var(--tm-card);color:var(--tm-text-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;}
.txn-mobi-pills .txn-pill.active{background:var(--tm-purple);border-color:var(--tm-purple);color:#fff;}
.txn-mobi-group{margin-bottom:16px;}
.txn-mobi-gtitle{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--tm-text-soft);margin-bottom:8px;}
.txn-mobi-gcard{background:var(--tm-card);border:1px solid var(--tm-card-line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;}
.txn-mobi-item + .txn-mobi-item{border-top:1px solid var(--tm-card-line);}
.txn-mobi-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 14px;cursor:pointer;}
.txn-mobi-ic{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:19px;flex-shrink:0;}
.txn-mobi-main{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.txn-mobi-name{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tm-text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.txn-mobi-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--tm-text-soft);margin-top:2px;}
.txn-mobi-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;}
.txn-mobi-amt.in{color:var(--tm-teal);}
.txn-mobi-amt.ex{color:var(--tm-coral);}
.txn-mobi-amt.tr{color:var(--tm-text);}
.txn-mobi-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:0 14px 12px 68px;}
.txn-mobi-detail.hidden{display:none;}
.tmd-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--tm-card-line);color:var(--tm-text-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;}
.tmd-btn.del{color:var(--tm-coral);}
.txn-mobiwrap .txn-items-panel{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--tm-text);}
.txn-mobiwrap .txn-items-panel .ti-row{border-bottom:1px dashed var(--tm-card-line);}
.txn-mobi-empty{text-align:center;color:var(--tm-text-soft);padding:30px 10px;}
.txn-mobi-fab{display:none;}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .txn-mobi-fab{display:flex;position:fixed;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:80px;z-index:59;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px;border-radius:999px;border:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#6d28d9);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(109,40,217,.45);cursor:pointer;}
}

/* ===================================================================
   PART 2.3 — VOICE COMMAND SYSTEM
=================================================================== */
/* Sprint 24 — Mic is the primary Home Screen action: centered,
   larger than Scan/+, so it reads first. Same button element,
   same openVoicePanel()/startListening() engine as before — only
   position/size changed. */
.mic-fab{position:fixed;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:86px;width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;font-size:30px;border:none;box-shadow:var(--shadow);cursor:pointer;z-index:61;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:0;transition:.15s;}
.mic-fab.hidden{display:none!important;}
.mic-fab.listening{background:var(--rust);animation:micPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
@media(min-width:769px){.mic-fab{bottom:28px;}}
@media(max-width:768px){.mic-fab{bottom:78px;}}
@keyframes micPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(181,72,52,.45);}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 16px rgba(181,72,52,0);}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(181,72,52,0);}}

/* ===================================================================
   REAL CONVERSATION ENGINE — CHAT UI (App.Chat)
   ChatGPT-style chat bubble interface, additive to the existing app.
   Reuses --ink/--teal/--paper/--line tokens already defined in :root
   so it matches the existing visual language without redesigning it.
=================================================================== */
/* .chat-fab removed Sprint 24 — its button element is now #scanFabBtn
   (.scan-fab, defined above). App.Chat is unaffected; see build log. */
.chat-sheet .sheet{max-width:480px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:min(640px,82vh);}
.chat-sheet-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%;min-height:0;}
.chat-messages{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;padding:6px 2px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin:8px 0;}
.chat-msg{max-width:82%;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.42;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;}
.chat-msg.user{align-self:flex-end;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;}
.chat-msg.ai{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-bottom-left-radius:4px;}
.chat-typing{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:11px 14px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;gap:4px;}
.chat-typing span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink-soft);opacity:.35;animation:chatTypingBlink 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;display:inline-block;}
.chat-typing span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s;}
.chat-typing span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s;}
@keyframes chatTypingBlink{0%,80%,100%{opacity:.25;}40%{opacity:.9;}}
.chat-quick-replies{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.chat-quick-chip{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--teal);background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal);font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;}
.chat-quick-chip:hover{opacity:.8;}
.chat-input-row{display:flex;gap:8px;}
.chat-input-row input{flex:1;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;}
.chat-footer-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;}
.chat-footer-btn{flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12.5px;cursor:pointer;}
.chat-footer-btn:hover{background:var(--paper);}

.voice-sheet .sheet{max-width:520px;}
.voice-status-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.voice-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink-soft);flex:none;}
.voice-dot.live{background:var(--rust);animation:micPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
/* Sprint 24 — small waveform, shown next to voice-dot while listening.
   Purely decorative CSS bars; toggled by the existing updateMicButtons(),
   no new listening state. */
.voice-waveform{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;height:16px;}
.voice-waveform.hidden{display:none!important;}
.voice-waveform span{width:3px;height:100%;border-radius:2px;background:var(--rust);animation:waveBar 1s ease-in-out infinite;}
.voice-waveform span:nth-child(1){animation-delay:0s;}
.voice-waveform span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.12s;}
.voice-waveform span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.24s;}
.voice-waveform span:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.36s;}
.voice-waveform span:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.48s;}
@keyframes waveBar{0%,100%{transform:scaleY(.25);}50%{transform:scaleY(1);}}
.voice-status-text{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.voice-transcript-box{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;min-height:44px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.voice-transcript-box .interim{color:var(--ink-soft);font-style:italic;}
.voice-mic-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px;}
.voice-text-fallback{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.voice-text-fallback input{flex:1;}
.voice-confirm-card{background:var(--gold-soft);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;}
[data-theme="dark"] .voice-confirm-card{background:#2A2313;}
.voice-confirm-card .vc-heard{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;font-style:italic;}
.voice-answer-card{background:var(--teal-soft);border:1px solid var(--teal);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;}
[data-theme="dark"] .voice-answer-card{background:#0F2420;}
.voice-session-log{max-height:200px;overflow-y:auto;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;}
.voice-session-item{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.voice-session-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.voice-session-item b{color:var(--ink);}
.voice-conv-banner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;}
.voice-conv-banner button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--rust);color:var(--rust);border-radius:7px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;}
.voice-examples{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.7;}
.voice-examples code{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 6px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;}
.voice-hist-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.voice-hist-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.voice-hist-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.voice-hist-transcript{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
.voice-hist-outcome{font-size:12.5px;}
.toggle-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);gap:12px;}
.toggle-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.toggle-row .tr-label{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;}
.toggle-row .tr-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px;}
.switch{position:relative;width:42px;height:24px;flex:none;}
.switch input{opacity:0;width:0;height:0;}
.switch .slider{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;}
.switch .slider::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:18px;height:18px;left:3px;top:3px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;transition:.15s;}
.switch input:checked + .slider{background:var(--teal);}
.switch input:checked + .slider::before{transform:translateX(18px);}

/* ===================================================================
   PART 2.4 — VOICE ENGINE FOUNDATION (App.Voice) — UI
   Additive styles only. Nothing here changes any rule above; the
   existing mic-fab / voice-sheet / voice-dot styles are untouched.
=================================================================== */
.ve-status-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(136px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:12px 0 4px;}
.ve-status-tile{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;}
.ve-status-tile .ve-label{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:4px;}
.ve-status-tile .ve-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
.ve-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink-soft);flex:none;}
.ve-dot.ok{background:var(--teal);}
.ve-dot.warn{background:var(--gold);}
.ve-dot.bad{background:var(--rust);}
.ve-dot.live{background:var(--rust);animation:micPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
.ve-mic-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:14px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.ve-mic-btn{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;border:none;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:0;transition:.15s;flex:none;}
.ve-mic-btn.listening{background:var(--rust);animation:micPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
.ve-mic-btn.processing{background:var(--gold);}
.ve-mic-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed;animation:none;}
.ve-mic-actions{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.ve-range-row{margin:12px 0;}
.ve-range-row label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}
.ve-range-row label span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;}
.ve-range-row input[type="range"]{width:100%;}
.ve-future-note .tag{margin:2px 4px 2px 0;}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   SMART ATTACHMENT ENGINE — styles (Sprint 11 / App.Attachments)
--------------------------------------------------------------- */
.attach-zone{border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;background:var(--paper-raised);}
.attach-zone:hover,.attach-zone.dragover{border-color:var(--gold);background:var(--gold-soft);}
.attach-zone-icon{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.attach-zone-text{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.attach-zone-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px;}
.attach-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;}
.attach-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper-raised);}
.attach-thumb{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--paper);flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);}
.attach-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;}
.attach-meta{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.attach-name{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.attach-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.attach-actions{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0;}
.attach-actions button{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.attach-actions button:hover{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);}
.attach-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:11px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);}
/* Sprint 25 — Multi-Item Transaction Entry (additive; reused by the New
   Transaction form's item repeater and the Items Editor sheet). */
.items-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-size:11px;background:var(--gold-soft);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 8px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;}
.mi-item-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--paper-raised);margin-bottom:8px;}
.mi-item-main{display:flex;flex:1 1 220px;gap:8px;min-width:0;}
.mi-item-main input{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.mi-item-main input.mi-amount{flex:0 0 92px;}
.mi-item-actions{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.mi-item-actions button{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);font-size:13px;line-height:0;}
.mi-item-actions button:hover{opacity:.8;}
.mi-item-more{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;width:100%;margin-top:6px;}
.mi-item-more input{flex:1 1 140px;min-width:0;}
.mi-item-more.hidden{display:none;}
.txn-items-panel{padding:10px 14px;background:var(--paper-raised);border-radius:10px;margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;}
.txn-items-panel .ti-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.txn-items-panel .ti-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.txn-items-row.hidden{display:none;}
.attach-badge:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);}
.attach-progress{height:3px;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px;}
.attach-progress-bar{height:100%;background:var(--teal);width:0%;transition:width .2s;}
.attach-warn{font-size:11px;color:var(--rust);margin-top:4px;}
.attach-viewer-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.attach-viewer-stage{width:100%;max-height:60vh;overflow:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--paper);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:200px;}
.attach-viewer-stage img{max-width:100%;transition:transform .15s;}
.attach-viewer-stage iframe{width:100%;height:60vh;border:none;border-radius:12px;}
.attach-viewer-stage audio,.attach-viewer-stage video{width:100%;}
.attach-viewer-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;}
.attach-viewer-controls button{background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);}
.attach-viewer-controls button:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}
.attach-waveform{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;height:28px;width:100%;}
.attach-waveform span{flex:1;background:var(--teal-soft);border-radius:2px;min-width:2px;}
.attach-fullscreen .attach-viewer-stage{max-height:none;height:100vh;border-radius:0;}
[data-attach-fullscreen="1"]{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:200;background:rgba(18,32,58,.92);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.attach-fs-close{position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;background:var(--paper-raised);border:none;border-radius:8px;width:34px;height:34px;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;z-index:201;}
.attach-empty-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;padding:10px 0;}
.attach-dup-warn{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:6px;}
.attach-field-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;}
.attach-field-row input,.attach-field-row select{width:100%;font-size:12px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink);}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   PRODUCTION OCR ENGINE — styles (Sprint 12 / App.OCR)
--------------------------------------------------------------- */
.ocr-scan-zone{border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--paper-raised);margin-bottom:10px;}
.ocr-scan-zone:hover{border-color:var(--teal);}
.ocr-scan-zone-icon{font-size:20px;}
.ocr-scan-zone-text{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
.ocr-scan-zone-sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
.ocr-progress-wrap{margin:8px 0;background:var(--line);border-radius:99px;height:6px;overflow:hidden;}
.ocr-progress-bar{height:100%;width:0%;background:var(--teal);transition:width .2s ease;}
.ocr-progress-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:4px;}
.ocr-field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;}
.ocr-field-grid label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;display:block;margin-bottom:3px;}
.ocr-field-grid input,.ocr-field-grid select,.ocr-field-grid textarea{width:100%;font-size:13px;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body);}
.ocr-conf-low{border-color:var(--rust) !important;}
.ocr-conf-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle;}
.ocr-conf-high{background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal);}
.ocr-conf-med{background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--gold);}
.ocr-conf-low-badge{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);}
.ocr-warn-box{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:10px;}
.ocr-raw-toggle{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:8px;display:inline-block;}
.ocr-raw-text{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin-top:6px;max-height:160px;overflow-y:auto;}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   INTELLIGENT AUTO-SAVE ENGINE — styles (Sprint 12 / App.AutoSave)
--------------------------------------------------------------- */
.autosave-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.autosave-banner.hidden{display:none;}
.autosave-banner-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0;}
.autosave-status-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);margin-right:6px;}
.autosave-status-dot.pending{background:var(--gold);}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   AI REPORTS & SMART ANALYTICS ENGINE — styles (Sprint 14 / App.Reports)
--------------------------------------------------------------- */
.rep-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);}
.rep-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.rep-row .rr-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-width:0;}
.rep-row .rr-name{font-weight:600;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}
.rep-row .rr-sub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:11px;}
.rep-row .rr-val{flex:none;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.rep-trend{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;flex:none;}
.rep-trend.up{background:var(--rust-soft);color:var(--rust);}
.rep-trend.down{background:var(--teal-soft);color:var(--teal);}
.rep-trend.flat{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink-soft);}
.rep-focus-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:10px;}

/* ===================================================================
   Sprint 26 — Home Screen Visual Redesign ("Khaata AI" reference look)
   -------------------------------------------------------------------
   Scope: Home tab only (#view-dashboard) + the shared topbar/bottom
   nav chrome that sits around every tab. No other tab's own markup,
   classes, or layout is touched by this block — Transactions/Budgets/
   Goals/Insights/etc. keep exactly the cards/CSS they had before.

   Approach: a brand-new set of --kh-* custom properties (does NOT
   redefine --paper/--ink/--tm-* etc., so nothing else in the app
   re-themes itself) plus a new #khHome subtree built by JS from the
   same helpers/state the rest of the dashboard already uses (fmt(),
   sum(), incomeTxns/expenseTxns, txnIcon(), App.Dashboard.Cards/
   Analytics, state.budgets/state.goals). The previous Home content —
   #stsCard, #heroGrid, #smartDashboardRoot — is left fully intact and
   still renders normally (nothing there was deleted or renamed); it's
   only hidden with CSS beneath the new design so its numbers keep
   computing correctly with zero risk, and is still reachable via the
   existing "See full breakdown" toggle right below it.
=================================================================== */
:root{
  /* Sprint 33 — Flagship palette finally set to the exact requested
     values (prior sprints' changelogs claimed this but the tokens
     had drifted back to placeholder hex — fixed for real here). */
  --kh-bg1:#0B1020; --kh-bg2:#0E1330;
  --kh-purple:#7C3AED; --kh-purple2:#A78BFA; --kh-purple-soft:rgba(124,58,237,.18);
  --kh-cyan:#14F1D9; --kh-cyan-soft:rgba(20,241,217,.14);
  --kh-card:#111833; --kh-card2:#141B3A; --kh-card-line:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  --kh-glass:rgba(255,255,255,.05); --kh-glass-line:rgba(255,255,255,.11);
  --kh-text:#F7F7FB; --kh-text-soft:rgba(247,247,251,.54);
  --kh-green:#33D690; --kh-green-soft:rgba(51,214,144,.15);
  --kh-red:#FF5C72; --kh-red-soft:rgba(255,92,114,.15);
  --kh-glow-purple:0 0 22px rgba(124,58,237,.4);
  --kh-glow-cyan:0 0 18px rgba(20,241,217,.4);
  /* Full-Breakdown card accent palette — 8 distinct gradients cycled
     across the 16 breakdown cards (2 cards per color) per the
     "different colorful gradient accent" requirement. */
  --kh-bd1a:#7C3AED; --kh-bd1b:#A78BFA;
  --kh-bd2a:#14F1D9; --kh-bd2b:#0EA5E9;
  --kh-bd3a:#F472B6; --kh-bd3b:#C026D3;
  --kh-bd4a:#34D399; --kh-bd4b:#059669;
  --kh-bd5a:#FBBF24; --kh-bd5b:#F97316;
  --kh-bd6a:#F87171; --kh-bd6b:#DC2626;
  --kh-bd7a:#818CF8; --kh-bd7b:#4F46E5;
  --kh-bd8a:#22D3EE; --kh-bd8b:#0891B2;
  /* Sprint 32 — Flagship Redesign Pass (Home). Additive elevation/motion
     tokens layered on top of the existing --kh-* system above; nothing
     removed or renamed, so any other rule still referencing the old
     tokens keeps working unchanged. */
  --kh-r-xl:28px; --kh-r-lg:22px; --kh-r-md:18px; --kh-r-sm:14px; --kh-r-xs:11px;
  --kh-shadow-card:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.03) inset, 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  --kh-shadow-pop:0 20px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.55);
  --kh-shadow-hero:0 24px 60px -12px rgba(76,63,180,.5), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset;
  --kh-ease-spring:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  --kh-ease-out:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
}
#stsCard, #heroGrid, #smartDashboardRoot{display:none;}

/* ---- Shared chrome: topbar + bottom nav ------------------------- */
.topbar.kh-topbar{border-bottom:none;margin-bottom:14px;padding:10px 0 6px;}
.kh-logo{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:var(--kh-glow-purple);}
.kh-brandwrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.kh-brandtext .brand-mark{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:16.5px;color:var(--kh-text,var(--ink));display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;line-height:1.15;}
.kh-brandtext .brand-mark .kh-ai-text{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple2),var(--kh-cyan));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
.kh-brandtext .brand-sub{font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:9.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px;}
@media(max-width:768px){ body[data-theme] #businessProfileSwitcher{display:none;} }
.kh-topbar .icon-btn{background:var(--kh-glass);border-color:var(--kh-glass-line);color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-icon-btn{position:relative;background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:50%;width:38px;height:38px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:var(--kh-text);font-size:15px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);transition:border-color .2s,transform .15s var(--kh-ease-spring),background .2s;}
.kh-icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--kh-purple2);}
.kh-icon-btn:active{transform:scale(.90);background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);}
.kh-icon-btn .kh-dot{position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kh-cyan);border:1.5px solid var(--kh-bg1);display:none;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(20,241,217,.9);}
.kh-icon-btn .kh-dot.show{display:block;}
.kh-avatar-btn{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple2),var(--kh-purple));color:#fff;border:none;box-shadow:var(--kh-glow-purple);}
.kh-avatar-btn .kh-avatar-status{position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kh-purple2);border:1.5px solid var(--kh-bg1);}

.bottom-nav.kh-bottomnav{background:rgba(13,18,38,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(140%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(140%);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:22px;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:10px;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-pop);}
.kh-bottomnav button{position:relative;color:var(--kh-text-soft)!important;transition:transform .2s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh-bottomnav button:active{transform:scale(.90);}
.kh-bottomnav button .bn-ic svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:var(--kh-text-soft);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:stroke .2s,filter .2s,transform .25s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh-bottomnav button.active{color:var(--kh-purple2)!important;}
.kh-bottomnav button.active .bn-ic svg{stroke:var(--kh-purple2);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(124,58,237,.85));transform:translateY(-1px);}
.kh-bottomnav button.active::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:2px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:16px;height:3px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(124,58,237,.8);}
@media(min-width:769px){.bottom-nav.kh-bottomnav{max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;}}

/* ---- Home screen content ----------------------------------------- */
/* Sprint 32 — Flagship Redesign Pass. Visual/motion only: same
   renderKhaataHomeV2() markup contract (same #khHome root, same
   data-kh-action wiring, same ids read/written by JS), same data
   sources — only the component structure + design language changed.
   Cards fade+rise in on paint (pure CSS, staggered via nth-child). */
.kh2-home{background:var(--kh-bg1);border-radius:26px;padding:20px 16px 108px;color:var(--kh-text);margin-bottom:14px;position:relative;isolation:isolate;}
.kh2-home::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-120px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:340px;height:340px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(108,92,231,.16),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:-1;filter:blur(10px);}
.kh2-home>*{animation:khRise .55s var(--kh-ease-out) both;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.01s;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.05s;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.10s;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.15s;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.20s;}
.kh2-home>*:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.25s;}
@keyframes khRise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.kh2-home>*{animation:none;}}

/* -- Greeting -- */
.kh2-topline{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;}
.kh2-greet-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.4px;color:var(--kh-text);line-height:1.15;}
.kh2-greet-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:4px;}
.kh2-greet-date{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);padding:6px 11px;border-radius:99px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);}

/* -- Hero balance card: single elevated "wallet" block, balance zone
      fused with a translucent income/expense/savings strip beneath it
      so it reads as one instrument rather than four separate boxes. -- */
.kh2-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--kh-r-xl);
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 130% at 100% -10%,rgba(47,230,200,.20),transparent 55%),
    radial-gradient(90% 120% at -10% 110%,rgba(165,148,255,.18),transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(155deg,#3A2E8C 0%,#241C63 48%,#130E38 100%);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-hero);margin-bottom:14px;}
.kh2-hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-70%;left:-25%;width:55%;height:230%;
  background:linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 42%,rgba(255,255,255,.09) 49%,rgba(255,255,255,.14) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.09) 51%,transparent 58%);
  transform:rotate(9deg);pointer-events:none;animation:khHeroSheen 8s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes khHeroSheen{0%,100%{left:-35%;}50%{left:125%;}}
.kh2-particles{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden;}
.kh2-particles span{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);box-shadow:0 0 6px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.35);animation:khFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;}
.kh2-particles span:nth-child(1){width:4px;height:4px;left:12%;top:74%;animation-delay:0s;}
.kh2-particles span:nth-child(2){width:3px;height:3px;left:30%;top:26%;animation-delay:.9s;background:rgba(47,230,200,.85);}
.kh2-particles span:nth-child(3){width:5px;height:5px;left:60%;top:62%;animation-delay:1.7s;}
.kh2-particles span:nth-child(4){width:3px;height:3px;left:76%;top:18%;animation-delay:2.5s;background:rgba(47,230,200,.75);}
.kh2-particles span:nth-child(5){width:4px;height:4px;left:90%;top:52%;animation-delay:3.3s;}
@keyframes khFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.3;}50%{transform:translateY(-14px);opacity:.85;}}

.kh2-hero-main{position:relative;padding:22px 22px 20px;}
.kh2-hero-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:relative;}
.kh2-hero-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.6px;}
.kh2-hero-ic{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;}
.kh2-eye{background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:50%;width:30px;height:30px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;padding:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:transform .15s var(--kh-ease-spring),background .15s;}
.kh2-eye:active{transform:scale(.88);background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);}
.kh2-hero-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:-.5px;position:relative;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.kh2-hero-amt .kh-decimal{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;opacity:.62;}
.kh2-hero-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;position:relative;}
.kh2-hero-pillwrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}
.kh2-hero-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);color:var(--kh-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(47,230,200,.18);width:fit-content;}
.kh2-hero-pill.down{color:#FF9DAD;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,92,114,.18);}
.kh2-hero-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.48);}
.kh2-hero-spark{width:112px;height:44px;flex-shrink:0;opacity:.9;}

.kh2-hero-strip{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;background:rgba(0,0,0,.18);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);}
.kh2-hero-cell{padding:13px 10px 14px;text-align:center;position:relative;}
.kh2-hero-cell+.kh2-hero-cell::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;bottom:14px;width:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);}
.kh2-hero-cell-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.9px;}
.kh2-hero-cell-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;}
.kh2-hero-cell-dot.in{background:var(--kh-green);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--kh-green);}
.kh2-hero-cell-dot.ex{background:#FF8FA0;box-shadow:0 0 6px #FF8FA0;}
.kh2-hero-cell-dot.sv{background:var(--kh-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--kh-cyan);}
.kh2-hero-cell-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;color:#fff;margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:-.2px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.kh2-hero-cell-delta{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;margin-top:3px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);}
.kh2-hero-cell-delta.up{color:#8CF0C4;}
.kh2-hero-cell-delta.down{color:#FFAEB9;}

/* -- Quick actions: horizontal capsule row, Apple-Wallet style -- */
.kh2-qa-scroll{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 2px 6px;margin-bottom:16px;scrollbar-width:none;}
.kh2-qa-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
.kh2-qa-btn{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px 8px 8px;color:var(--kh-text);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-card);transition:transform .16s var(--kh-ease-spring),border-color .16s,background .16s;}
.kh2-qa-btn:active{transform:scale(.95);background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);}
.kh2-qa-ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0;}
.kh2-qa-ic svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}
.kh2-qa-ic.income{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#39D98A,#0E9A5C);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(57,217,138,.35);}
.kh2-qa-ic.expense{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF6B7F,#C4243F);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(255,107,127,.32);}
.kh2-qa-ic.transfer{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5FA8FF,#2B5FE0);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(95,168,255,.32);}
.kh2-qa-ic.ai{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-cyan),var(--kh-purple));box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(47,230,200,.32);}

/* -- Section shell -- */
.kh2-card{background:var(--kh-glass);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid var(--kh-card-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-lg);padding:18px 17px 12px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-card);transition:border-color .18s,transform .18s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh2-card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:13px;}
.kh2-card-title{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--kh-text);letter-spacing:-.1px;}
.kh2-card-title-eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.1px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
.kh2-viewall{background:none;border:none;color:var(--kh-purple2);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:4px 0 4px 8px;transition:opacity .15s;}
.kh2-viewall:active{opacity:.55;}
.kh2-headright{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.kh2-dots{background:none;border:none;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-size:16px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:2px;padding:0 2px;}

/* -- Transactions -- */
.kh2-txn-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);}
.kh2-txn-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.kh2-txn-ic{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
.kh2-txn-body{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.kh2-txn-name{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--kh-text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}
.kh2-txn-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:2px;}
.kh2-txn-right{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;}
.kh2-txn-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;display:block;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.1px;}
.kh2-txn-amt.in{color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh2-txn-amt.ex{color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh2-txn-date{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:2px;}

/* -- Budget -- */
.kh2-budget-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
.kh2-ring{flex-shrink:0;text-align:center;}
.kh2-ring-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-align:center;margin-top:-2px;line-height:1.3;}
.kh2-budget-info{width:100%;}
.kh2-budget-figs-row{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;}
.kh2-budget-name{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;}
.kh2-budget-figs{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--kh-text);letter-spacing:-.2px;}
.kh2-bar-track{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);overflow:hidden;}
.kh2-bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(47,230,200,.4);transition:width .6s var(--kh-ease-out);}
.kh2-bar-fill.over{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-red),#FB923C);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,92,114,.4);}
.kh2-budget-left{font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:8px;text-align:right;width:100%;}

/* -- Goals -- */
.kh2-goal-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;}
.kh2-goal-ic{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--kh-purple-soft);color:var(--kh-purple2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(108,92,231,.2);}
.kh2-goal-body{flex:1;min-width:0;}
.kh2-goal-name{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh2-goal-figs{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin:3px 0 7px;font-family:var(--font-mono);}
.kh2-goal-target{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:6px;}
.kh2-goal-pct{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--kh-cyan);flex-shrink:0;}

/* -- AI insight: quiet premium card, not a loud fill -- */
.kh2-insight{position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:flex-start;
  background:linear-gradient(155deg,rgba(108,92,231,.22) 0%,rgba(19,14,56,.9) 55%,rgba(8,8,14,.95) 100%);
  border:1px solid rgba(165,148,255,.22);border-radius:var(--kh-r-lg);padding:16px 17px;
  box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(20,14,60,.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
.kh2-insight-ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(47,230,200,.2);}
.kh2-insight-title{font-weight:800;font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-cyan);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;}
.kh2-insight-headline{font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:#fff;margin-top:5px;}
.kh2-insight-text{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.45;}

.kh2-empty{font-size:12px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-style:italic;padding:14px 2px;}
.kh2-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}
@media(min-width:640px){.kh2-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start;}}
@keyframes khFlash{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(108,92,231,.35);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 48px rgba(47,230,200,.6);}}
.kh-flash{animation:khFlash 1s ease-in-out 2;}

/* Sprint 30 — premium restyle for the Camera/Upload sheet (reached
   from the new "+" plus-menu). Layered on top of the existing
   .sheet/.more-grid rules, which still apply as-is for the secondary
   "More formats" row below. */
.kh-scan-sheet{background:var(--kh-bg2);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:22px 22px 0 0;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-scan-sheet .sheet-title{color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-scan-sheet .card-note{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}
.kh-scan-primary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px;}
.kh-scan-card{
  background:var(--kh-glass);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 6px;
  text-align:center;cursor:pointer;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-text);
  transition:transform .15s,border-color .15s;
}
.kh-scan-card:active{transform:scale(.95);}
.kh-scan-card:hover{border-color:var(--kh-purple2);}
.kh-scan-ic{display:block;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:8px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(124,58,237,.5));}
.kh-scan-more-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.kh-scan-sheet .more-item{background:var(--kh-glass);border-color:var(--kh-glass-line);color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-scan-sheet .qa-close{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}
.kh-scan-sheet .sheet-handle{background:var(--kh-glass-line);}
.kh-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}
@media(min-width:640px){.kh-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start;}}
@keyframes khFlash{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(124,58,237,.4);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 46px rgba(20,241,217,.65);}}
.kh-flash{animation:khFlash 1s ease-in-out 2;}

/* ===================================================================
   Sprint 32 — Flagship chrome refresh: topbar, bottom nav, FABs.
   Appended last in the stylesheet so it wins the cascade over every
   earlier declaration for the same selectors (#fabBtn, .mic-fab,
   .kh-plus-menu, .kh-bottomnav, .kh-topbar, …) without deleting any
   of them — same ids/classes/click handlers, visual layer only.
=================================================================== */
.kh-topbar{position:relative;}
.kh-logo{box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(108,92,231,.4);}
.kh-icon-btn{box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25);}
.kh-avatar-btn{box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(108,92,231,.4);}

.bottom-nav.kh-bottomnav{background:rgba(9,9,14,.78);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.09);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);padding:6px 4px 8px;}
.kh-bottomnav button.active::after{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));}

#fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple),#4C3FC4);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(108,92,231,.5),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);width:56px;height:56px;font-weight:400;}
#fabBtn.kh-fab-trigger.kh-open{box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(108,92,231,.6),0 0 0 8px rgba(108,92,231,.16);}
#micFabBtn.mic-fab{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-cyan),#1AAE97);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,230,200,.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
#micFabBtn.mic-fab.listening{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-red),#C4243F);}
.kh-plus-menu{background:rgba(15,14,26,.92);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px);box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-pop);}
.kh-plus-item{border-color:var(--kh-glass-line);}
.kh-plus-item .kh-plus-ic{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));}

/* ================================================================
   BUDGET PLANNER — flagship dashboard redesign (scoped entirely to
   #view-budgets via the .kbud wrapper). Re-skins the existing
   .budget-row/.bar-track/.bar-fill/.insight/.dot/.card-note/
   .empty-note markup that renderBudgets() and App.Budget.UI.render()
   already emit — no markup contract broken, only new selectors +
   small additive class hooks below.
================================================================ */
.kbud{
  --kbg:#0B1020; --kbg2:#0F1526; --kglass:rgba(255,255,255,.05); --kline:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  --kpurple:#7C3AED; --kcyan:#14F1D9; --kemerald:#22C55E; --korange:#FB923C;
  --ktext:#EEF1FA; --ktext-soft:#8B92AB;
  background:
    radial-gradient(680px 420px at 12% -8%, rgba(124,58,237,.20), transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(600px 380px at 100% 0%, rgba(20,241,217,.10), transparent 55%),
    var(--kbg);
  border-radius:26px;
  padding:20px 16px 32px;
  font-family:var(--font-body);
  color:var(--ktext);
}
.kbud *{box-sizing:border-box;}
.kbud .kbud-num{font-family:var(--font-mono);}

@keyframes kbudFadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes kbudPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.45;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:.85;transform:scale(1.08);}}
@keyframes kbudShimmer{0%{background-position:-200% 0;}100%{background-position:200% 0;}}

/* header */
.kbud-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:4px 6px 22px;}
.kbud-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin:0;color:#fff;}
.kbud-subtitle{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);line-height:1.5;max-width:34ch;}
.kbud-header-icon{
  flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(124,58,237,.35), rgba(20,241,217,.18));
  border:1px solid var(--kline);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(124,58,237,.06), 0 0 22px rgba(124,58,237,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  color:var(--kcyan);
  cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
}
.kbud-header-icon:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(124,58,237,.1), 0 0 28px rgba(124,58,237,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.15);}
.kbud-header-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px;}

/* generic glass card */
.kbud-card{
  background:var(--kglass);
  border:1px solid var(--kline);
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:22px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
  box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(2,4,16,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.kbud-card-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:17px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.kbud-card-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 14px;}

/* --- overview (signature gradient-border hero) --- */
.kbud-overview-wrap{
  position:relative;border-radius:24px;padding:1px;margin-bottom:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(124,58,237,.65), rgba(20,241,217,.35), rgba(124,58,237,.15));
}
.kbud-overview{
  border-radius:23px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #131a30, #0d1226);
  padding:24px 22px;border:none;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);margin-bottom:0;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.kbud-overview::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-40%;right:-15%;width:55%;height:170%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(20,241,217,.10), transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;
}
.kbud-hero-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px;position:relative;}
.kbud-hero-score{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 12px 7px 8px;border-radius:99px;
  background:rgba(20,241,217,.08);border:1px solid rgba(20,241,217,.25);
}
.kbud-hero-score-icon{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--kpurple), var(--kcyan));}
.kbud-hero-score-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--ktext-soft);line-height:1.2;}
.kbud-hero-score-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px;color:#fff;}
.kbud-overview-grid{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;}
.kbud-ring-wrap{position:relative;flex:none;width:150px;height:150px;}
.kbud-ring-wrap::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:-16px;border-radius:50%;z-index:-1;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(124,58,237,.4), transparent 70%);filter:blur(16px);
  animation:kbudPulse 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.kbud-ring{width:150px;height:150px;transform:rotate(-90deg);}
.kbud-ring-track{fill:none;stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.08);stroke-width:12;}
.kbud-ring-fill{fill:none;stroke:url(#kbudRingGrad);stroke-width:12;stroke-linecap:round;transition:stroke-dashoffset .9s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);}
.kbud-ring-fill.over{stroke:var(--korange);}
.kbud-ring-center{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.kbud-ring-pct{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:27px;color:#fff;}
.kbud-ring-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-top:2px;}
.kbud-stats{flex:1;min-width:220px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px 22px;}
.kbud-stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;}
.kbud-stat-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1px;box-shadow:0 0 8px currentColor;}
.kbud-stat-label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);}
.kbud-stat-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;}
.kbud-bartrack{margin-top:22px;height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
.kbud-barfill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--kpurple), var(--kcyan));transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.kbud-barfill::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.35), transparent);
  background-size:200% 100%;animation:kbudShimmer 2.4s linear infinite;
}
.kbud-health{margin-top:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);position:relative;}
.kbud-health-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ktext-soft);flex:none;}
.kbud-health.good .kbud-health-dot{background:var(--kemerald);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--kemerald);}
.kbud-health.warn .kbud-health-dot{background:var(--korange);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--korange);}
.kbud-health.bad .kbud-health-dot{background:#F43F5E;box-shadow:0 0 8px #F43F5E;}
.kbud-health.good{color:#8FE8B0;}
.kbud-health.warn{color:#FFC898;}
.kbud-health.bad{color:#FFB0BE;}

/* --- category cards (reuses .budget-row/.bar-track/.bar-fill/.card-note/.empty-note) --- */
.kbud-cat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:12px;}
.kbud .budget-row{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--kline);
  border-radius:18px;padding:17px 16px 15px;margin-bottom:0;
  transition:transform .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  animation:kbudFadeUp .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) both;
}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.4);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:active{transform:scale(.98);}
.kbud .budget-row::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ca,var(--kpurple)),var(--cb,var(--kcyan)));}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+1),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+1){--ca:var(--kh-bd1a);--cb:var(--kh-bd1b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+2),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+2){--ca:var(--kh-bd2a);--cb:var(--kh-bd2b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+3),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+3){--ca:var(--kh-bd3a);--cb:var(--kh-bd3b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+4),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+4){--ca:var(--kh-bd4a);--cb:var(--kh-bd4b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+5),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+5){--ca:var(--kh-bd5a);--cb:var(--kh-bd5b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+6),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+6){--ca:var(--kh-bd6a);--cb:var(--kh-bd6b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+7),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+7){--ca:var(--kh-bd7a);--cb:var(--kh-bd7b);}
.kbud-cat-grid .budget-row:nth-child(8n+8),.kbud #advBudgetList .budget-row:nth-child(8n+8){--ca:var(--kh-bd8a);--cb:var(--kh-bd8b);}
.kbud .budget-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:11px;}
.kbud .budget-cat{font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.kbud .budget-cat-icon{
  flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:9px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:13px;background:linear-gradient(155deg,var(--ca,var(--kpurple)),var(--cb,var(--kcyan)));
}
.kbud .budget-figs{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);text-align:right;}
.kbud .bar-track{height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:none;overflow:hidden;}
.kbud .bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--kcyan), var(--kemerald));transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);}
.kbud .bar-fill.warn{background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--korange), #FFD08A);}
.kbud .bar-fill.over{background:linear-gradient(90deg, #F43F5E, #FB923C);}
.kbud .card-note{color:var(--ktext-soft);font-size:11.5px;margin-top:8px;}
.kbud .empty-note{color:var(--ktext-soft);font-size:13px;padding:10px 2px;}

/* --- form fields (Set/Update + Advanced create) — floating glass labels --- */
.kbud-form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:18px 14px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.kbud-field{position:relative;}
.kbud-field label{
  position:absolute;top:-8px;left:13px;padding:0 7px;background:#111832;color:var(--ktext-soft);
  font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px;border-radius:6px;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;
}
.kbud-field input, .kbud-field select{
  width:100%;padding:16px 14px 13px;border-radius:14px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--kline);color:#fff;
  font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:14px;
  transition:border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s, background .2s;
  appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;
}
.kbud-field select{
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%238B92AB' stroke-width='2'><path d='M6 9l6 6 6-6'/></svg>");
  background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right 14px center;background-size:16px;padding-right:36px;
}
.kbud-field input::placeholder{color:#5B6178;}
.kbud-field input:focus, .kbud-field select:focus{
  outline:none;border-color:transparent;background-color:rgba(255,255,255,.065);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--kpurple), 0 0 18px rgba(124,58,237,.35);
}
.kbud-field input:focus ~ label, .kbud-field select:focus ~ label{color:var(--kcyan);}
.kbud-btn-primary{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  width:100%;padding:15px 20px;border:none;border-radius:15px;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;color:#fff;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg, var(--kpurple), #9F5FF5 45%, var(--kcyan));
  box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(124,58,237,.4);
  transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, filter .15s ease;
}
.kbud-btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(124,58,237,.6);}
.kbud-btn-primary:active{transform:scale(.98);}

/* --- Smart Budget AI: four premium glass insight cards --- */
.kbud-ai{position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.kbud-ai::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-60%;right:-20%;width:60%;height:220%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(20,241,217,.14), transparent 65%);
  pointer-events:none;
}
.kbud-ai-head{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px;position:relative;}
.kbud-ai-icon{
  flex:none;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(124,58,237,.5), rgba(20,241,217,.3));
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(20,241,217,.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.15);
  font-size:19px;
}
.kbud-insight-grid{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:13px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.kbud-insight-card{
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--kline);
  border-radius:18px;padding:16px;transition:transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  animation:kbudFadeUp .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) both;
}
.kbud-insight-card:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.02s;--ia:var(--kh-bd1a);--ib:var(--kh-bd1b);}
.kbud-insight-card:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.07s;--ia:var(--kh-bd6a);--ib:var(--kh-bd6b);}
.kbud-insight-card:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.12s;--ia:var(--kh-bd4a);--ib:var(--kh-bd4b);}
.kbud-insight-card:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.17s;--ia:var(--kh-bd5a);--ib:var(--kh-bd5b);}
.kbud-insight-card::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-45%;right:-30%;width:75%;height:75%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--ia,var(--kpurple)), transparent 70%);opacity:.22;filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none;
}
.kbud-insight-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.45);background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);}
.kbud-insight-icon{
  position:relative;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:17px;margin-bottom:11px;background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--ia,var(--kpurple)), var(--ib,var(--kcyan)));
  box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2);
}
.kbud-insight-title{position:relative;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:7px;letter-spacing:.1px;}
.kbud-insight-value{position:relative;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:21px;color:#fff;}
.kbud-insight-desc{position:relative;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.5;}
.kbud-insight-desc-list{position:relative;max-height:148px;overflow-y:auto;}
.kbud-insight-desc-list .insight{border-bottom:1px solid var(--kline);padding:7px 0;}
.kbud-insight-desc-list .insight:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.kbud-ai-metrics{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.kbud-ai-metric{background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--kline);border-radius:15px;padding:12px 14px;}
.kbud-ai-metric-label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-bottom:5px;}
.kbud-ai-metric-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:#fff;}
.kbud-ai-section{position:relative;margin-top:16px;}
.kbud-ai-section-title{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-bottom:6px;}
.kbud .insight{border-bottom:1px solid var(--kline);padding:10px 0;}
.kbud .insight p{color:#D7DAEA;}
.kbud .insight .dot.good{background:var(--kemerald);}
.kbud .insight .dot.warn{background:var(--korange);}
.kbud .insight .dot.bad{background:#F43F5E;}
.kbud .insight .dot.info{background:var(--kcyan);}

/* --- advanced budget feature cards --- */
.kbud-feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(128px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.kbud-feature{
  position:relative;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--kline);border-radius:17px;padding:15px 30px 15px 14px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);transition:transform .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  animation:kbudFadeUp .45s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) both;
}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.02s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.05s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.08s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.11s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.14s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.17s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.20s;}
.kbud-feature-grid .kbud-feature:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.23s;}
.kbud-feature:hover{border-color:rgba(124,58,237,.5);background:rgba(124,58,237,.08);transform:translateY(-3px);}
.kbud-feature:active{transform:scale(.96);}
.kbud-feature::after{content:'›';position:absolute;top:14px;right:13px;color:var(--ktext-soft);font-size:17px;line-height:1;transition:transform .15s ease, color .15s ease;}
.kbud-feature:hover::after{color:var(--kcyan);transform:translateX(3px);}
.kbud-feature-icon{
  width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:18px;margin-bottom:11px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18);
}
.kbud-feature-name{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;}
.kbud-feature-desc{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.4;}

/* --- budget analytics --- */
.kbud-analytics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:14px;}
.kbud-chart-box{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--kline);border-radius:18px;padding:16px;
  animation:kbudFadeUp .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) both;
}
.kbud-chart-box h4{margin:0 0 12px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;}
.kbud-chart-box canvas{max-height:190px;}
.kbud-chart-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--ktext-soft);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5;}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .kbud{padding:16px 12px 26px;}
  .kbud-overview-grid{gap:16px;}
  .kbud-ring-wrap{width:130px;height:130px;}
  .kbud-ring{width:130px;height:130px;}
  .kbud-cat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .kbud .budget-row,.kbud-insight-card,.kbud-feature,.kbud-chart-box{animation:none;}
  .kbud-ring-wrap::before,.kbud-barfill::after{animation:none;}
}
/* ===================================================================
   SPRINT 34 — PREMIUM INSIGHTS REDESIGN (AI Financial Intelligence)
   Scoped entirely to #view-insights via .kh-ins-* classes so no other
   tab/view is touched. Reuses the existing --kh-* dark-luxury tokens,
   khSparklineSvg()/khRingSvg()/khPctDelta() helpers, and every number
   still comes from state.transactions/state.budgets/state.goals —
   nothing here is simulated or hard-coded.
=================================================================== */
#view-insights{position:relative;}
#view-insights .card{display:none;} /* old plain cards fully replaced by kh-ins- markup below */
#view-insights .kh-ins-section{display:block;}

@keyframes khInsIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes khInsPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.55;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.06);}}
@keyframes khInsGlowMove{0%{background-position:0% 50%;}50%{background-position:100% 50%;}100%{background-position:0% 50%;}}
@keyframes khInsDrift{0%{transform:translate(0,0);}50%{transform:translate(8px,-10px);}100%{transform:translate(0,0);}}
@keyframes khInsBreathe{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(20,241,217,.35);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(20,241,217,0);}}

.kh-ins-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin:2px 0 16px;animation:khInsIn .45s var(--kh-ease-out) both;}
.kh-ins-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.3px;color:var(--kh-text);margin:0;}
.kh-ins-title b{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple2),var(--kh-cyan));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
.kh-ins-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:3px;}
.kh-ins-brain{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,rgba(124,58,237,.35),rgba(20,241,217,.12) 70%);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);box-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(124,58,237,.45),0 0 44px rgba(20,241,217,.18);}
.kh-ins-brain svg{width:26px;height:26px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(20,241,217,.7));}
.kh-ins-brain::after{content:'';position:absolute;}

.kh-ins-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--kh-r-xl);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#151B3E 0%,#0E1330 55%,#0B1020 100%);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-hero);padding:20px 20px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;animation:khInsIn .5s var(--kh-ease-out) both .04s;}
.kh-ins-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-40%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,rgba(124,58,237,.28),transparent 45%),radial-gradient(circle at 85% 75%,rgba(20,241,217,.22),transparent 45%);animation:khInsDrift 9s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none;}
.kh-ins-hero-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;position:relative;margin-bottom:14px;}
.kh-ins-hero-tag{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.3px;}
.kh-ins-hero-tag .dot-ic{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kh-cyan);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--kh-cyan);animation:khInsPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;}
.kh-ins-hero-body{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.kh-ins-ring-col{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex:1;min-width:230px;}
.kh-ins-ring-wrap{position:relative;width:132px;height:132px;flex-shrink:0;}
.kh-ins-ring-wrap svg{transform:rotate(-90deg);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(124,58,237,.5));}
.kh-ins-ring-center{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.kh-ins-ring-num{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:32px;color:var(--kh-text);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.5px;}
.kh-ins-ring-max{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;}
.kh-ins-status-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-width:150px;}
.kh-ins-status-label{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-status-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;font-family:var(--font-display);}
.kh-ins-status-badge.good{color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh-ins-status-badge.warn{color:#FBBF24;}
.kh-ins-status-badge.bad{color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-delta-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(51,214,144,.15);color:var(--kh-green);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(51,214,144,.18);width:fit-content;}
.kh-ins-delta-chip.down{background:rgba(255,92,114,.15);color:var(--kh-red);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,92,114,.18);}
.kh-ins-delta-chip.flat{background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);color:var(--kh-text-soft);box-shadow:none;}
.kh-ins-hero-brainwrap{margin-left:auto;width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 30%,rgba(124,58,237,.5),rgba(20,241,217,.15) 65%,transparent 80%);}
.kh-ins-hero-brainwrap svg{width:52px;height:52px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(20,241,217,.85));animation:khInsPulse 3.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
.kh-ins-hero-brainwrap::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-14px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(20,241,217,.25);animation:khInsPulse 3.2s ease-in-out infinite .3s;}
@media(max-width:560px){.kh-ins-hero-brainwrap{display:none;}}
.kh-ins-conf-wrap{position:relative;margin-top:16px;}
.kh-ins-conf-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.kh-ins-conf-row span.val{color:var(--kh-cyan);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:11.5px;}
.kh-ins-conf-bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;}
.kh-ins-conf-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan),var(--kh-purple2));background-size:200% 100%;animation:khInsGlowMove 3s ease infinite;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(20,241,217,.5);width:0%;transition:width 1s var(--kh-ease-out);}

.kh-ins-summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:11px;margin-bottom:14px;}
@media(min-width:640px){.kh-ins-summary-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
.kh-ins-sum-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card) 68%);border:1px solid var(--kh-card-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-md);padding:14px 13px;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-card);animation:khInsIn .5s var(--kh-ease-out) both;transition:transform .2s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh-ins-sum-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);}
.kh-ins-sum-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-26px;right:-26px;width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ca,var(--kh-purple));filter:blur(32px);opacity:.30;}
.kh-ins-sum-ic{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ca,var(--kh-purple)),var(--cb,var(--kh-cyan)));box-shadow:0 6px 14px -4px var(--ca,var(--kh-purple));}
.kh-ins-sum-label{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-sum-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:var(--kh-text);margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:-.3px;}
.kh-ins-sum-chg{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;margin-top:3px;display:inline-block;}
.kh-ins-sum-chg.up{color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh-ins-sum-chg.down{color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-sum-spark{width:100%;height:26px;margin-top:6px;opacity:.85;}

.kh-ins-section{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card) 70%);border:1px solid var(--kh-card-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-lg);padding:16px 16px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-card);animation:khInsIn .5s var(--kh-ease-out) both;}
.kh-ins-sec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;cursor:default;}
.kh-ins-sec-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-ins-sec-ic{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(124,58,237,.4);flex-shrink:0;}
.kh-ins-sec-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin:2px 0 10px;}
.kh-ins-sec-toggle{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:50%;width:28px;height:28px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s var(--kh-ease-spring);flex-shrink:0;}
.kh-ins-sec-toggle.open{transform:rotate(180deg);color:var(--kh-cyan);}
.kh-ins-viewall{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-cyan);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;}

.kh-ins-digest-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;}
@media(min-width:560px){.kh-ins-digest-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr) 1.3fr;}}
.kh-ins-digest-tile{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-sm);padding:10px 9px;}
.kh-ins-digest-tile .lbl{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-digest-tile .amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:4px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-ins-digest-tile .mini-bars{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:2px;height:16px;margin-top:6px;}
.kh-ins-digest-tile .mini-bars i{flex:1;border-radius:2px;background:var(--kh-cyan);opacity:.85;display:block;}
.kh-ins-digest-tile.exp .mini-bars i{background:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-digest-tile.sav .mini-bars i{background:var(--kh-purple2);}
.kh-ins-digest-top{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,58,237,.16),rgba(20,241,217,.10));border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-sm);padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:2px;}
.kh-ins-digest-top .lbl{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-digest-top .cat{font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--kh-text);margin-top:2px;}
.kh-ins-digest-top .amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--kh-cyan);margin-top:1px;}

.kh-ins-stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;}
@media(min-width:640px){.kh-ins-stat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:22px;}}
.kh-ins-stat-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:6px 0;}
.kh-ins-stat-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;}
.kh-ins-stat-name{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:var(--kh-text);font-weight:600;}
.kh-ins-stat-name .ic{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);flex-shrink:0;}
.kh-ins-stat-val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-size:12px;}
.kh-ins-stat-bar{height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;}
.kh-ins-stat-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));width:0%;transition:width 1.1s var(--kh-ease-out);box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(20,241,217,.35);}
.kh-ins-stat-fill.warn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F97316,#FBBF24);}
.kh-ins-stat-fill.bad{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#DC2626,#F87171);}

.kh-ins-reco-scroll{display:flex;gap:11px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 2px 8px;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.kh-ins-reco-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px;}
.kh-ins-reco-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:99px;}
.kh-ins-reco-card{scroll-snap-align:start;flex:0 0 auto;width:210px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card));border:1px solid var(--kh-card-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-md);padding:13px 13px 12px;box-shadow:var(--kh-shadow-card);}
.kh-ins-reco-ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ca,var(--kh-purple)),var(--cb,var(--kh-cyan)));box-shadow:0 6px 14px -4px var(--ca,var(--kh-purple));margin-bottom:9px;}
.kh-ins-reco-title{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:var(--kh-text);line-height:1.25;}
.kh-ins-reco-txt{font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.4;min-height:44px;}
.kh-ins-reco-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:9px;}
.kh-ins-reco-conf{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh-ins-reco-badge{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:99px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;}
.kh-ins-reco-badge.high{background:rgba(255,92,114,.16);color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-reco-badge.medium{background:rgba(251,191,36,.16);color:#FBBF24;}
.kh-ins-reco-badge.low{background:rgba(51,214,144,.16);color:var(--kh-green);}

.kh-ins-mom-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
.kh-ins-mom-legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-mom-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.kh-ins-mom-legend i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;}
.kh-ins-mom-bars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;align-items:end;height:150px;padding-top:6px;}
.kh-ins-mom-group{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:center;gap:5px;height:100%;}
.kh-ins-mom-bar{width:15px;border-radius:6px 6px 2px 2px;position:relative;transition:height 1s var(--kh-ease-out);}
.kh-ins-mom-bar.prev{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
.kh-ins-mom-bar.cur{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--kh-cyan),var(--kh-purple));box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(20,241,217,.4);}
.kh-ins-mom-labels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);text-align:center;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;margin-top:-6px;}
.kh-ins-mom-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;}
.kh-ins-mom-kpi{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-sm);padding:9px 11px;}
.kh-ins-mom-kpi .lbl{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-mom-kpi .val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:14px;margin-top:3px;}

.kh-ins-cat-scroll{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 2px 8px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;}
.kh-ins-cat-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px;}
.kh-ins-cat-card{flex:0 0 auto;width:120px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--kh-card2),var(--kh-card));border:1px solid var(--kh-card-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-md);padding:12px 11px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.kh-ins-cat-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-20px;right:-20px;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ca,var(--kh-purple));filter:blur(26px);opacity:.28;}
.kh-ins-cat-ic{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ca,var(--kh-purple)),var(--cb,var(--kh-cyan)));margin-bottom:8px;}
.kh-ins-cat-name{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-ins-cat-spark{width:100%;height:20px;margin-top:6px;opacity:.85;}
.kh-ins-cat-trend{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;margin-top:4px;}
.kh-ins-cat-trend.up{color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-cat-trend.down{color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh-ins-cat-trend.flat{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}

.kh-ins-timeline{position:relative;padding-left:20px;}
.kh-ins-timeline::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:5px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:1.5px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--kh-purple),transparent);}
.kh-ins-tl-item{position:relative;padding-bottom:16px;}
.kh-ins-tl-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}
.kh-ins-tl-item::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-20px;top:3px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dotc,var(--kh-green));box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--dotc,var(--kh-green));}
.kh-ins-tl-date{font-size:10px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.kh-ins-tl-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:3px;}
.kh-ins-tl-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;}
.kh-ins-tl-ic{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;}
.kh-ins-tl-name{font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-ins-tl-sub{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:1px;}
.kh-ins-tl-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:var(--kh-text);}
.kh-ins-tl-badge{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:3px;display:inline-block;}
.kh-ins-tl-badge.high{background:rgba(255,92,114,.16);color:var(--kh-red);}
.kh-ins-tl-badge.medium{background:rgba(251,191,36,.16);color:#FBBF24;}
.kh-ins-tl-badge.normal{background:rgba(51,214,144,.16);color:var(--kh-green);}

.kh-ins-bubbles{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:center;padding:8px 0 4px;}
.kh-ins-bubble{border-radius:50%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,var(--ca,var(--kh-purple)),var(--cb,var(--kh-cyan)));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -6px var(--ca,var(--kh-purple)),0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08) inset;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0;animation:khInsPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;}
.kh-ins-bubble .b-name{font-weight:800;font-size:11px;}
.kh-ins-bubble .b-amt{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;opacity:.9;margin-top:1px;}
.kh-ins-bubble-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:14px;}
.kh-ins-bubble-stat{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-sm);padding:9px 8px;text-align:center;}
.kh-ins-bubble-stat .lbl{font-size:9px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-bubble-stat .val{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;color:var(--kh-text);}

#view-insights .form-grid input, #view-insights .form-grid select{background:var(--kh-glass)!important;border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line)!important;color:var(--kh-text)!important;border-radius:var(--kh-r-sm)!important;padding:11px 13px!important;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);font-family:var(--font-mono);}
#view-insights .form-grid label{color:var(--kh-text-soft)!important;font-size:10.5px!important;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;font-weight:700;}
.kh-ins-calc-btn{width:100%;margin-top:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan))!important;background-size:200% 100%;border:none!important;color:#0B1020!important;font-weight:800!important;border-radius:999px!important;padding:12px!important;box-shadow:0 10px 26px -8px rgba(124,58,237,.7);transition:background-position .4s ease,transform .15s var(--kh-ease-spring);}
.kh-ins-calc-btn:hover{background-position:100% 0;transform:translateY(-1px);}
.kh-ins-pred-card{background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(124,58,237,.18),rgba(20,241,217,.10));border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);border-radius:var(--kh-r-md);padding:14px;margin-top:12px;animation:khInsIn .4s var(--kh-ease-out) both;}
.kh-ins-pred-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.kh-ins-pred-big{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:24px;color:var(--kh-text);letter-spacing:-.4px;}
.kh-ins-pred-big.pos{color:var(--kh-green);}
.kh-ins-pred-big.neg{color:var(--kh-red);}

.kh-ins-slider-wrap{margin-bottom:6px;}
.kh-ins-slider-presets{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.kh-ins-preset-btn{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;font-family:var(--font-mono);}
.kh-ins-preset-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));color:#0B1020;border-color:transparent;}
.kh-ins-range{-webkit-appearance:none;width:100%;height:6px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--kh-purple),var(--kh-cyan));outline:none;margin:10px 0;}
.kh-ins-range::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--kh-purple);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(124,58,237,.7);cursor:pointer;}
.kh-ins-range::-moz-range-thumb{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--kh-purple);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(124,58,237,.7);cursor:pointer;}
.kh-ins-range-val{text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:800;font-size:20px;color:var(--kh-text);margin-bottom:2px;}

.kh-ins-empty{padding:16px 4px;text-align:center;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-size:12.5px;}
#view-insights .insight{border-bottom:1px dashed var(--kh-glass-line);}
#view-insights .insight p{color:var(--kh-text);}
#view-insights .empty-note{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}
#view-insights .kpi{background:var(--kh-glass);border:1px solid var(--kh-glass-line);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);}
#view-insights .kpi-label{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}
#view-insights .kpi-value{color:var(--kh-text);}
#view-insights .kpi-sub{color:var(--kh-text-soft);}
</style>
</head>
<body data-theme="dark">
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="autosave-banner hidden" id="autosaveRecoveryBanner">
    <span id="autosaveRecoveryText">You have unsaved work from a previous session.</span>
    <div class="autosave-banner-actions">
      <button class="btn small teal" id="autosaveRecoveryRestoreBtn">Restore</button>
      <button class="btn small secondary" id="autosaveRecoveryDiscardBtn">Discard</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="topbar kh-topbar">
    <div class="brand kh-brandwrap">
      <div class="kh-logo">KC</div>
      <div class="kh-brandtext">
        <span class="brand-mark">Khaata<span class="kh-ai-text">AI</span></span>
        <span class="brand-sub">AI-Powered Finance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gsearch-wrap">
      <span class="gsearch-icon">⌕</span>
      <input type="text" id="globalSearch" class="gsearch-input" placeholder="Search transactions, dates, categories, amounts…">
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-actions">
      <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".csv,.json" class="hidden">
      <!-- Sprint 23 — App.Business: Personal <-> Business profile switcher.
           Additive only — nothing else in the topbar was moved or resized.
           Hidden on narrow screens (Sprint 26) since the new mobile Home
           header doesn't have room for it; still fully present/working
           on wider screens. -->
      <select id="businessProfileSwitcher" title="Switch profile"
        style="max-width:160px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper-raised);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);font:inherit;"></select>
      <button class="icon-btn kh-icon-btn" id="mobileSearchBtn" title="Search" style="display:none;">⌕</button>
      <!-- Sprint 26 — new, purely additive icon buttons matching the
           reference Home header. They reuse existing, real behaviour:
           the bell scrolls to + flashes the AI Insight banner (built
           from the same App.Dashboard.Analytics data already shown
           there) and shows a dot only when there's a warning/critical
           insight; the avatar opens the existing "More" sheet. Neither
           button stores or fakes any new data.
           Sprint 27 — visual-only glass/blur circular restyle of these
           same buttons (kh-icon-btn CSS updated); no id/class removed,
           no handler touched. -->
      <button class="kh-icon-btn" id="khNotifBtn" title="Insights"><span>🔔</span><span class="kh-dot" id="khNotifDot"></span></button>
      <button class="kh-icon-btn kh-avatar-btn" id="khAvatarBtn" title="Menu">👤<span class="kh-avatar-status"></span></button>
      <button class="icon-btn kh-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle theme">◐</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-view="dashboard">Home</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="entry">Add Entry</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="transactions">Transactions</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="budgets">Budgets</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="goals">Goals</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="insights">Insights</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="advisor">AI Advisor</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="accounts">Accounts</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="recurring">Recurring</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="categories">Categories &amp; Tags</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="debts">Debts &amp; Loans</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="creditcards">Credit Cards</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="investments">Investments</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="forecast">Cash Flow Forecast</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="affordability">Can I Spend This?</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="food">Food Analysis</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="report">Monthly Report</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="reports">AI Reports</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="search">Search Results</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="data">Data &amp; Backup</button>
    <button class="tab" data-view="voice">Voice Assistant</button>
  </div>

  <!-- DASHBOARD -->
  <div class="view active" id="view-dashboard">
    <!-- Sprint 26 — new Home screen (reference-matched look). Built and
         kept fresh entirely by renderKhaataHomeV2() below; every figure
         in it comes from the same state/helpers the rest of the app
         already uses. -->
    <div id="khHome"></div>

    <div class="sts-card" id="stsCard"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid" id="heroGrid"></div>

    <!-- SMART DASHBOARD (App.Dashboard) — additive; everything above and
         below this block is unchanged from before Sprint 13. -->
    <div id="smartDashboardRoot"></div>

    <div id="dashBreakdownWrap">
      <div class="kh-bd-head">
        <div class="kh-bd-title">Full Breakdown</div>
        <button type="button" class="kh-bd-toggle" id="dashDetailsToggle">Show ▾</button>
      </div>
      <div id="dashDetailsPanel" class="hidden">
        <div class="kpi-grid kh-bd-grid" id="kpiGrid"></div>
        <div class="chart-grid kh-bd-charts" id="dashCharts"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ENTRY -->
  <div class="view" id="view-entry">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <div class="card-title">New Transaction</div>
          <div class="seg" id="typeSeg">
            <button data-type="expense" class="active">Expense</button>
            <button data-type="income">Income</button>
            <button data-type="transfer">Transfer</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form id="txnForm">
          <div class="form-grid" id="transferFields" style="display:none;">
            <div><label>From Account</label><select id="f_fromAccount"></select></div>
            <div><label>To Account</label><select id="f_toAccount"></select></div>
            <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="f_transferAmount" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="0.00"></div>
            <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="f_transferDate"></div>
            <div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="f_transferNotes"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="normalFields">
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="f_date" required></div>
            <div><label>Time</label><input type="time" id="f_time"></div>
            <div id="f_catWrap"><label>Category</label><select id="f_category"></select></div>
            <div id="f_subcatWrap"><label>Subcategory</label><select id="f_subcategory"><option value="">— none —</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;">
            <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="f_amount" min="0" step="0.01" required placeholder="0.00"></div>
            <div><label>Account</label><select id="f_account"></select></div>
            <div><label>Payment Mode</label>
              <select id="f_mode">
                <option>Cash</option><option>UPI</option><option>Card</option><option>Bank Transfer</option><option>Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div><label>Tags (comma separated)</label><input type="text" id="f_tags" placeholder="#Work, #Essential"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;">
            <div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label id="f_itemLabel">Item / Description</label><input type="text" id="f_item" placeholder="e.g. Amul curd 400g" list="descSuggestions"><datalist id="descSuggestions"></datalist></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-note" id="autoCatHint" style="margin-top:6px;"></div>
          <!-- Sprint 25 — Multi-Item Transaction Entry (additive). Hidden by
               default; the single Amount + Item/Description fields above
               remain the default entry path and are unchanged. -->
          <div class="row-actions" style="margin-top:6px;">
            <button type="button" class="link-btn" id="multiItemToggleBtn">🧾 Add multiple items in this transaction</button>
          </div>
          <div id="multiItemWrap" class="hidden" style="margin-top:8px;">
            <div id="miList"></div>
            <div class="row-actions" style="margin-top:2px;">
              <button type="button" class="btn secondary small" id="miAddItemBtn">+ Add Item</button>
              <span class="card-note">Total: <strong id="miTotalDisplay">₹0.00</strong></span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:6px;">Tip: with the Voice Assistant, try "Food expense. Milk 60. Peanut 120. Save."</div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;">
            <div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="f_notes"></div>
          </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;">
            <label>Scan a receipt, bill, or invoice (OCR) — auto-fills the form above</label>
            <div class="ocr-scan-zone" id="ocrScanZone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Scan receipt or bill">
              <div class="ocr-scan-zone-icon">📷</div>
              <div>
                <div class="ocr-scan-zone-text">Tap to scan a receipt / bill / invoice / UPI screenshot</div>
                <div class="ocr-scan-zone-sub">Reads merchant, amount, GST, date, items &amp; more — you confirm before anything saves</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <input type="file" id="ocrScanInput" hidden accept="image/*" capture="environment">
            <div class="ocr-progress-wrap hidden" id="ocrProgressWrap"><div class="ocr-progress-bar" id="ocrProgressBar"></div></div>
            <div class="ocr-progress-label hidden" id="ocrProgressLabel"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;">
            <label>Attachments (optional) — receipts, bills, invoices, PDFs, photos, voice notes, video, documents</label>
            <div class="attach-zone" id="entryAttachZone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Add attachments">
              <div class="attach-zone-icon">📎</div>
              <div class="attach-zone-text">Tap to add files, or drag &amp; drop here</div>
              <div class="attach-zone-sub">Images, PDF, audio, video, text/documents · up to 15 MB each</div>
            </div>
            <input type="file" id="entryAttachInput" multiple hidden accept="image/*,application/pdf,audio/*,video/*,text/plain,.doc,.docx,.txt">
            <div class="attach-progress hidden" id="entryAttachProgress"><div class="attach-progress-bar" id="entryAttachProgressBar"></div></div>
            <div class="attach-list" id="entryAttachList"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="row-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Save Transaction</button>
            <span class="card-note" id="entryHint">Entries save automatically and update your dashboard instantly.</span>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Custom Category / Subcategory</div>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div><label>Applies to</label>
            <select id="cc_type"><option value="expense">Expense category</option><option value="income">Income source</option></select>
          </div>
          <div><label>Name</label><input type="text" id="cc_name" placeholder="e.g. Subscriptions"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn secondary small" id="addCustomCatBtn">+ Add Category</button></div>
        <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
          <div><label>Add subcategory under</label><select id="sc_parent"></select></div>
          <div><label>Subcategory name</label><input type="text" id="sc_name" placeholder="e.g. Groceries"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn secondary small" id="addSubcatBtn">+ Add Subcategory</button></div>
        <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:14px;">Custom categories and subcategories appear immediately in dropdowns and throughout your reports. Manage the full list under Categories &amp; Tags.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TRANSACTIONS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-transactions">
    <!-- New mobile-app-style header, shown only <=768px (see CSS).
         Reuses the same data/filter functions as the card below —
         no separate filtering logic. -->
    <div class="txn-mobiwrap">
      <div class="txn-mobi-head">
        <div class="txn-mobi-title">Transactions</div>
        <div class="txn-mobi-actions">
          <button type="button" class="txn-mobi-icon-btn" id="txnMobiSearchBtn" title="Search">🔍</button>
          <button type="button" class="txn-mobi-icon-btn" id="txnMobiFilterBtn" title="Filters">🎚️</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="txn-mobi-summary" id="txnMobiSummary"></div>
      <div class="txn-mobi-pills" id="txnMobiPills">
        <button type="button" class="txn-pill active" data-ttype="all">All</button>
        <button type="button" class="txn-pill" data-ttype="income">Income</button>
        <button type="button" class="txn-pill" data-ttype="expense">Expense</button>
        <button type="button" class="txn-pill" data-ttype="transfer">Transfer</button>
      </div>
      <div id="txnMobiList"></div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="txn-mobi-fab" id="txnMobiAddBtn">➕ Add Transaction</button>

    <div class="card" id="txnFiltersCard">
      <div class="filters">
        <div><label>Search</label><input type="text" id="tSearch" placeholder="item, notes, category…"></div>
        <div><label>Range</label>
          <select id="tRange">
            <option value="all">All time</option>
            <option value="today">Today</option>
            <option value="yesterday">Yesterday</option>
            <option value="week">This week</option>
            <option value="lastweek">Last week</option>
            <option value="month">This month</option>
            <option value="prevmonth">Previous month</option>
            <option value="last7">Last 7 days</option>
            <option value="last30">Last 30 days</option>
            <option value="custom">Custom range</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div id="customRangeWrap" class="hidden" style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
          <div><label>From</label><input type="date" id="tFrom"></div>
          <div><label>To</label><input type="date" id="tTo"></div>
        </div>
        <div><label>Type</label>
          <select id="tType"><option value="all">Income + Expense + Transfer</option><option value="income">Income only</option><option value="expense">Expense only</option><option value="transfer">Transfer only</option></select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="tCategory"><option value="all">All categories</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Subcategory</label><select id="tSubcategory"><option value="all">All subcategories</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Account</label><select id="tAccount"><option value="all">All accounts</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Payment Mode</label><select id="tMode"><option value="all">All modes</option><option>Cash</option><option>UPI</option><option>Card</option><option>Bank Transfer</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Tag</label><select id="tTag"><option value="all">All tags</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Min Amount</label><input type="number" id="tMin" placeholder="0"></div>
        <div><label>Max Amount</label><input type="number" id="tMax" placeholder="No limit"></div>
        <div><label>Sort</label>
          <select id="tSort">
            <option value="newest">Newest first</option>
            <option value="oldest">Oldest first</option>
            <option value="highest">Highest amount</option>
            <option value="lowest">Lowest amount</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="clearFiltersBtn">Clear Filters</button>
        <span class="card-note" id="undoDeleteNote"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Type</th><th>Category / Source</th><th>Item</th><th>Account</th><th>Mode</th><th style="text-align:right;">Amount</th><th></th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="txnTableBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="txn-cards" id="txnCards"></div>
      <div class="card-note" id="txnCount" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BUDGETS -->
  <!-- BUDGETS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-budgets">
  <div class="kbud">

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="kbud-header">
      <div>
        <h1 class="kbud-title">Budget Planner</h1>
        <p class="kbud-subtitle">Track, plan and optimize your monthly spending.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kbud-header-icon" title="Budget analytics" onclick="try{document.querySelector('[data-view=insights]').click();}catch(e){}">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-5 3 3 5-7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BUDGET OVERVIEW -->
    <div class="kbud-overview-wrap">
      <div class="kbud-overview">
        <div class="kbud-hero-top">
          <div></div>
          <div class="kbud-hero-score">
            <span class="kbud-hero-score-icon">🧠</span>
            <span>
              <span class="kbud-hero-score-label" style="display:block;">AI health score</span>
              <span class="kbud-hero-score-val" id="kbudScoreHero">--</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-overview-grid">
          <div class="kbud-ring-wrap">
            <svg class="kbud-ring" viewBox="0 0 160 160">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="kbudRingGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7C3AED"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#14F1D9"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <circle class="kbud-ring-track" cx="80" cy="80" r="70"/>
              <circle class="kbud-ring-fill" id="kbudRingFill" cx="80" cy="80" r="70"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="kbud-ring-center">
              <span class="kbud-ring-pct" id="kbudUsedPct">0%</span>
              <span class="kbud-ring-label">used</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="kbud-stats">
            <div class="kbud-stat"><span class="kbud-stat-dot" style="background:var(--kpurple);color:var(--kpurple);"></span><span class="kbud-stat-label">Total budget</span><span class="kbud-stat-val" id="kbudTotalBudget">₹0</span></div>
            <div class="kbud-stat"><span class="kbud-stat-dot" style="background:var(--korange);color:var(--korange);"></span><span class="kbud-stat-label">Total spent</span><span class="kbud-stat-val" id="kbudTotalSpent">₹0</span></div>
            <div class="kbud-stat"><span class="kbud-stat-dot" style="background:var(--kcyan);color:var(--kcyan);"></span><span class="kbud-stat-label">Remaining</span><span class="kbud-stat-val" id="kbudRemaining">₹0</span></div>
            <div class="kbud-stat"><span class="kbud-stat-dot" style="background:var(--kemerald);color:var(--kemerald);"></span><span class="kbud-stat-label">Savings rate</span><span class="kbud-stat-val" id="kbudSavingsPct">0%</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-bartrack"><div class="kbud-barfill" id="kbudOverallBar"></div></div>
        <div class="kbud-health" id="kbudHealth"><span class="kbud-health-dot"></span><span id="kbudHealthText">Set a budget to see your health status.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AI INSIGHTS -->
    <div class="kbud-card kbud-ai">
      <div class="kbud-ai-head">
        <div class="kbud-ai-icon">🤖</div>
        <div>
          <div class="kbud-card-title">Smart Budget AI</div>
          <div class="kbud-card-sub" style="margin:2px 0 0;">Recommendations, forecasts and alerts computed from your own recorded spending. Not professional financial advice.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kbud-insight-grid">
        <div class="kbud-insight-card">
          <div class="kbud-insight-icon">🧠</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-title">AI Budget Score</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-value" id="kbudScore">--</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-desc">How well this month's spending holds to plan.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-insight-card">
          <div class="kbud-insight-icon">⚠️</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-title">Overspending Alerts</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-desc-list" id="budgetAIAlerts"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-insight-card">
          <div class="kbud-insight-icon">📉</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-title">Expected Month-End Balance</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-value" id="kbudExpectedBalance">₹0</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-desc">Predicted savings: <b id="kbudPredictedSavings" style="color:#fff;">₹0</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-insight-card">
          <div class="kbud-insight-icon">💡</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-title">Smart Recommendation</div>
          <div class="kbud-insight-desc-list" id="budgetAIRecs"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kbud-ai-section">
        <div class="kbud-ai-section-title">Month-end forecast (budgeted categories)</div>
        <div id="budgetAIForecast"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CATEGORY BUDGETS -->
    <div class="kbud-card">
      <div class="kbud-card-title">This month's categories</div>
      <div class="kbud-card-sub">Budget vs actual, per category.</div>
      <div id="budgetList" class="kbud-cat-grid"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- SET / UPDATE BUDGET -->
    <div class="kbud-card">
      <div class="kbud-card-title">Set or update a budget</div>
      <div class="kbud-card-sub">Choose a category and its monthly limit.</div>
      <div class="kbud-form-grid">
        <div class="kbud-field"><select id="b_category"></select><label>Category</label></div>
        <div class="kbud-field"><input type="number" id="b_amount" min="0" step="1" placeholder="e.g. 5000"><label>Monthly budget (₹)</label></div>
      </div>
      <button class="kbud-btn-primary" id="saveBudgetBtn">Save Budget</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ADVANCED BUDGETS -->
    <div class="kbud-card">
      <div class="kbud-card-title">Advanced budgets</div>
      <div class="kbud-card-sub">The categories above stay simple monthly limits. Use these for anything else — a weekly eating-out cap, a per-account limit, or a budget for one trip or project.</div>
      <div class="kbud-feature-grid" id="kbudFeatureGrid">
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="category" data-period="daily">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(124,58,237,.22);color:#B794F6;">☀️</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Daily</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">A tight day-to-day cap</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="category" data-period="weekly">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(20,241,217,.16);color:#5EEAD4;">📅</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Weekly</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Reset every 7 days</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="category" data-period="monthly">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,.18);color:#86EFAC;">🗓️</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Monthly</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">The classic recurring limit</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="project" data-period="monthly">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(251,146,60,.18);color:#FDBA74;">📌</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Project</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Track by tagged spend</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="category" data-period="monthly" data-target="Travel">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(124,58,237,.22);color:#B794F6;">✈️</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Travel</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Cap one trip's spend</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="category" data-period="monthly" data-target="Bills">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(20,241,217,.16);color:#5EEAD4;">🔁</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Subscriptions</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Recurring bills in check</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="account" data-period="monthly">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,.18);color:#86EFAC;">👪</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Family</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Cap a shared account</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kbud-feature" data-scope="account" data-period="yearly">
          <span class="kbud-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(251,146,60,.18);color:#FDBA74;">💼</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-name">Business</span>
          <span class="kbud-feature-desc">Annual account ceiling</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="advBudgetList" class="kbud-cat-grid" style="margin-top:16px;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- CREATE ADVANCED BUDGET -->
    <div class="kbud-card" id="kbudAdvForm">
      <div class="kbud-card-title">Create an advanced budget</div>
      <div class="kbud-card-sub">Pick a card above to prefill this, or set it up manually.</div>
      <div class="kbud-form-grid">
        <div class="kbud-field">
          <select id="ab_scope">
            <option value="category">Category</option>
            <option value="subcategory">Subcategory</option>
            <option value="account">Account</option>
            <option value="project">Project (by tag)</option>
          </select>
          <label>Scope</label>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-field" id="ab_target_wrap"><select id="ab_target"></select><label id="ab_target_label">Category</label></div>
        <div class="kbud-field" id="ab_subcat_wrap" style="display:none;"><input type="text" id="ab_subcat" placeholder="e.g. Groceries"><label>Subcategory</label></div>
        <div class="kbud-field">
          <select id="ab_period">
            <option value="daily">Daily</option>
            <option value="weekly">Weekly</option>
            <option value="monthly" selected>Monthly</option>
            <option value="yearly">Yearly</option>
            <option value="custom">Custom (rolling days)</option>
          </select>
          <label>Period</label>
        </div>
        <div class="kbud-field" id="ab_customdays_wrap" style="display:none;"><input type="number" id="ab_customdays" min="1" step="1" placeholder="14"><label>Rolling window (days)</label></div>
        <div class="kbud-field"><input type="number" id="ab_amount" min="0" step="1"><label>Amount (₹)</label></div>
      </div>
      <button class="kbud-btn-primary" id="addAdvBudgetBtn">+ Add Advanced Budget</button>
    </div>

    <!-- BUDGET ANALYTICS -->
    <div class="kbud-card">
      <div class="kbud-card-title">Budget analytics</div>
      <div class="kbud-card-sub">A closer look at this month's spending shape, drawn from your recorded transactions.</div>
      <div class="kbud-analytics-grid">
        <div class="kbud-chart-box"><h4>🍩 Spending by category</h4><canvas id="kbud_c_donut"></canvas></div>
        <div class="kbud-chart-box"><h4>📊 Weekly spending</h4><canvas id="kbud_c_weekly"></canvas></div>
        <div class="kbud-chart-box"><h4>📈 Monthly trend</h4><canvas id="kbud_c_trend"></canvas></div>
      </div>
      <div class="kbud-chart-note">Trend and weekly charts use your full transaction history; category split uses this month's expenses.</div>
    </div>

  </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOD -->
  <div class="view" id="view-food">
    <div class="kpi-grid" id="foodKpis"></div>
    <div class="chart-grid" id="foodCharts"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- INSIGHTS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-insights">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="kh-ins-header">
      <div>
        <div class="kh-ins-title">AI <b>Financial Intelligence</b></div>
        <div class="kh-ins-sub">Understand your money with AI.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-ins-brain">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--kh-cyan)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.5 3a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v.3A3 3 0 0 0 5 9v1a3 3 0 0 0 .5 5.3A3 3 0 0 0 8 20h1.5V3H9.5Z"/><path d="M14.5 3a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v.3A3 3 0 0 1 19 9v1a3 3 0 0 1-.5 5.3A3 3 0 0 1 16 20h-1.5V3h.0Z"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero: AI Financial Health Score -->
    <div class="kh-ins-hero">
      <div class="kh-ins-hero-head">
        <div class="kh-ins-hero-tag"><span class="dot-ic"></span>AI Financial Health Score</div>
        <button class="kh-icon-btn" id="healthScoreInfoBtn" title="Based on your recorded data. Not professional financial advice." style="width:26px;height:26px;font-size:11px;">i</button>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-ins-hero-body">
        <div class="kh-ins-ring-col">
          <div class="kh-ins-ring-wrap" id="healthScoreRingWrap"></div>
          <div class="kh-ins-status-col">
            <div class="kh-ins-status-label">Monthly Health</div>
            <div class="kh-ins-status-badge" id="healthScoreStatusBadge">—</div>
            <div class="kh-ins-delta-chip flat" id="healthScoreDeltaChip">First score logged</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="kh-ins-hero-brainwrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--kh-cyan)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.5 3a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v.3A3 3 0 0 0 5 9v1a3 3 0 0 0 .5 5.3A3 3 0 0 0 8 20h1.5V3H9.5Z"/><path d="M14.5 3a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v.3A3 3 0 0 1 19 9v1a3 3 0 0 1-.5 5.3A3 3 0 0 1 16 20h-1.5V3h.0Z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-ins-conf-wrap">
        <div class="kh-ins-conf-row"><span>AI Confidence</span><span class="val" id="healthConfLabel">—</span></div>
        <div class="kh-ins-conf-bar"><div class="kh-ins-conf-fill" id="healthConfFill"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div id="healthScoreDetail" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);margin-top:12px;line-height:1.5;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- What's going well / needs attention / how to improve -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🧭</span>Health Breakdown</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="healthAreaGrid" style="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0;"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--kh-text);">✅ What's going well</div>
        <div id="healthGoodList"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;">
        <div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--kh-text);">⚠️ What needs attention</div>
        <div id="healthAttentionList"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;">
        <div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--kh-text);">💡 How to improve</div>
        <div id="healthImproveList"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Financial Summary -->
    <div class="kh-ins-summary-grid" id="insSummaryGrid"></div>

    <!-- Weekly Digest -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head">
        <div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">📅</span>Weekly Digest</div>
        <button class="kh-ins-sec-toggle open" id="weeklyDigestToggle">▾</button>
      </div>
      <div id="weeklyDigest"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- AI Spending Intelligence -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head">
        <div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🧠</span>AI Spending Intelligence</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">Patterns detected from your actual recorded transactions only.</div>
      <div id="spendingIntelList"></div>
      <div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin:14px 0 4px;color:var(--kh-text);">🔍 Key Insights</div>
      <div id="analysisList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Trends -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">📊</span>Category Trends</div></div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">Current month vs previous month, for your major spending categories.</div>
      <div id="categoryTrendTable"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Smart Recommendations -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">💡</span>Smart Recommendations</div></div>
      <div id="recoList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Month Comparison -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">📈</span>This Month vs Last Month</div></div>
      <div id="momPanel"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Unusual Expense Detection -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🚨</span>Unusual Expense Detection</div></div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">Flags expenses significantly higher than your usual spending for that category. This is not a fraud check — just a nudge to double-check.</div>
      <div id="unusualExpList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Small Frequent Expenses -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🫧</span>Small Frequent Expenses</div></div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">Repeated small purchases (under ₹100, more than 5 times a month) and their projected impact — labeled ESTIMATE.</div>
      <div id="smallFreqList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Financial What-If Simulator -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🧮</span>Financial Simulator</div></div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">ESTIMATE — does not modify actual stored data.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Monthly Income (₹)</label><input type="number" id="sim_income" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Monthly Expenses (₹)</label><input type="number" id="sim_expenses" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Extra Monthly Savings (₹)</label><input type="number" id="sim_extra" min="0" step="1" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Goal Contribution Adjustment (₹/month)</label><input type="number" id="sim_goal" step="1" value="0"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small secondary kh-ins-calc-btn" id="simRunBtn">✨ Calculate Prediction</button></div>
      <div id="simResult" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- What-If Simulator (sliders) -->
    <div class="kh-ins-section">
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-head"><div class="kh-ins-sec-title"><span class="kh-ins-sec-ic">🎯</span>What-If Simulator</div></div>
      <div class="kh-ins-sec-note">See how a small daily change could speed up your top goal.</div>
      <div class="kh-ins-slider-wrap">
        <div class="kh-ins-range-val"><span id="wi_amount_label">₹100</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--kh-text-soft);font-weight:600;"> less / day</span></div>
        <input type="range" id="wi_amount" class="kh-ins-range" min="0" max="1000" step="10" value="100">
        <div class="kh-ins-slider-presets">
          <button type="button" class="kh-ins-preset-btn" data-val="50">₹50</button>
          <button type="button" class="kh-ins-preset-btn active" data-val="100">₹100</button>
          <button type="button" class="kh-ins-preset-btn" data-val="200">₹200</button>
          <button type="button" class="kh-ins-preset-btn" data-val="500">₹500</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small secondary kh-ins-calc-btn" id="whatIfBtn">Simulate</button></div>
      <div id="whatIfResult" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- PERSONAL AI FINANCIAL ADVISOR (App.Advisor — Sprint 20). New tab,
       additive — sits alongside (not instead of) "Insights" and "AI
       Reports" above. Proactive: runs on load and after every save,
       instead of only computing when this tab is opened. -->
  <div class="view" id="view-advisor">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:2px;">🧭 AI Financial Advisor</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Proactively watches your patterns and flags things worth a look. Runs fully offline from your own recorded data — not professional financial advice.</div>
      <div id="advisorRiskSummary"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">⚠️ Active Alerts</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Overspending, low balance, duplicate-looking entries, and unusual transactions — checked every time you save one.</div>
      <div id="advisorAlerts"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">💡 Recommendations</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Prioritized suggestions across budgets, savings, goals, and debt. Dismiss one and it won't be repeated for a while.</div>
      <div id="advisorRecommendations"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">📅 Subscriptions &amp; Recurring Commitments</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">From your Recurring list, plus repeat charges that look like an untracked subscription.</div>
      <div id="advisorSubscriptions"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">🛟 Emergency Fund &amp; Savings Target</div>
      <div id="advisorSavings"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">💳 Loan Repayment Priority</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Your outstanding debts, ordered highest-interest-first (avalanche method) so interest cost is minimized.</div>
      <div id="advisorLoanPriority"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">📈 Investment Readiness</div>
      <div id="advisorInvestReadiness"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">🔍 Habit Patterns</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Income, expense, savings, and cash-flow patterns detected across your daily, monthly, and yearly data.</div>
      <div id="advisorPatterns"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- REPORT -->
  <div class="view" id="view-report">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">Monthly Report</div>
        <select id="reportMonth"></select>
      </div>
      <div id="reportBody"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI REPORTS & SMART ANALYTICS (App.Reports / App.Analytics — Sprint 14).
       New tab, additive — the "Monthly Report" and "Insights" tabs above
       are untouched. Everything on this tab is generated offline from
       state already in memory; see App.Reports at the end of this file. -->
  <div class="view" id="view-reports">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">AI Reports &amp; Smart Analytics</div>
        <span class="card-note">Offline · built from your own data · updates automatically</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Pick a time period and a report focus below. Every report, chart and insight on this tab is generated instantly from transactions you've actually entered — nothing is fetched from the internet.</div>
      <div class="filters" id="repFilterBar">
        <div><label>Period</label>
          <select id="rep_period">
            <option value="daily">Daily (today)</option>
            <option value="weekly">Weekly (last 7 days)</option>
            <option value="monthly" selected>Monthly (this month)</option>
            <option value="yearly">Yearly (this year)</option>
            <option value="custom">Custom range</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div id="repCustomWrap" class="hidden" style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
          <div><label>From</label><input type="date" id="rep_from"></div>
          <div><label>To</label><input type="date" id="rep_to"></div>
        </div>
        <div><label>Report Focus</label>
          <select id="rep_focus">
            <option value="overview">Overview</option>
            <option value="category">Category Report</option>
            <option value="subcategory">Subcategory Report</option>
            <option value="income">Income Report</option>
            <option value="expense">Expense Report</option>
            <option value="cashflow">Cash Flow Report</option>
            <option value="savings">Savings Report</option>
            <option value="loan">Loan Report</option>
            <option value="investment">Investment Report</option>
            <option value="budget">Budget Report</option>
            <option value="account">Account Report</option>
            <option value="paymentmethod">Payment Method Report</option>
            <option value="merchant">Merchant Report</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Transaction Type</label>
          <select id="rep_txnType"><option value="all">All</option><option value="income">Income only</option><option value="expense">Expense only</option><option value="transfer">Transfer only</option></select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="rep_category"><option value="all">All categories</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Subcategory</label><select id="rep_subcategory"><option value="all">All subcategories</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Account</label><select id="rep_account"><option value="all">All accounts</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Payment Mode</label><select id="rep_mode"><option value="all">All modes</option><option>Cash</option><option>UPI</option><option>Card</option><option>Bank Transfer</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Merchant / Item contains</label><input type="text" id="rep_merchant" placeholder="e.g. Zomato"></div>
        <div><label>Tag</label><select id="rep_tag"><option value="all">All tags</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Min Amount</label><input type="number" id="rep_min" placeholder="0"></div>
        <div><label>Max Amount</label><input type="number" id="rep_max" placeholder="No limit"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions" style="margin-bottom:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repClearBtn">Clear Filters</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repExportCsvBtn">Export CSV</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repExportJsonBtn">Export JSON</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repExportExcelBtn">Export Excel</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repPrintBtn">Print / Save PDF</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="repShareBtn">Share</button>
        <span class="card-note" id="repMeta"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="repInsightsCard">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="card-title">Smart AI Insights</div><span class="card-note">Written in plain language for everyone</span></div>
      <div id="repInsightsList"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Report Summary</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="repSummaryGrid"></div>
      <div id="repBody"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-grid" id="repCharts"></div>

    <div class="card" id="repPrintable" style="display:none;"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- GOALS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-goals">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">🛟 Emergency Fund</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Estimated from your recorded essential spending (food, travel, bills). This is always funded first, ahead of other goals.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Target — months of essential expenses to keep aside</label>
          <select id="bufferMonthsSelect">
            <option value="1">1 month</option><option value="2">2 months</option>
            <option value="3" selected>3 months</option><option value="6">6 months</option>
            <option value="12">12 months</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small secondary" id="saveBufferBtn">Save</button><span class="card-note" id="bufferNote"></span></div>
      <div id="efPanel" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Goals Overview</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="goalsOverviewKpis"></div>
      <div class="chart-box" style="margin-top:14px;padding:16px;"><h4>Goals Timeline (months to completion)</h4><canvas id="c_goaltimeline"></canvas></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;" id="goalFormTitle">Add a Goal</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Goals are funded in priority order — top of the list gets saved for first, then the next.</div>
      <input type="hidden" id="g_editid" value="">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Item Name</label><input type="text" id="g_name" placeholder="e.g. Laptop"></div>
        <div><label>Cost / Target (₹)</label><input type="number" id="g_cost" min="0" step="1" placeholder="40000"></div>
        <div><label>Category</label>
          <select id="g_category">
            <option value="Big Purchase" selected>Big Purchase</option>
            <option value="Savings Goal">Savings Goal</option>
            <option value="Vacation Goal">Vacation Goal</option>
            <option value="Education Goal">Education Goal</option>
            <option value="Vehicle Goal">Vehicle Goal</option>
            <option value="Home Goal">Home Goal</option>
            <option value="Investment Goal">Investment Goal</option>
            <option value="Business Goal">Business Goal</option>
            <option value="Custom Goal">Custom Goal</option>
            <option value="Investment">Investment</option>
            <option value="Other">Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Priority</label>
          <select id="g_priority">
            <option value="1">High</option>
            <option value="2" selected>Medium</option>
            <option value="3">Low</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Target Date (optional)</label><input type="date" id="g_targetdate"></div>
        <div><label>Fixed monthly amount (₹) — optional</label><input type="number" id="g_monthly" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Auto from your data"></div>
        <div><label>Fixed weekly amount (₹) — optional</label><input type="number" id="g_weekly" min="0" step="1" placeholder="optional"></div>
        <div><label>Fixed daily amount (₹) — optional</label><input type="number" id="g_daily" min="0" step="1" placeholder="optional"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><textarea id="g_notes" rows="2" placeholder="Any notes about this goal"></textarea></div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addGoalBtn">+ Add Goal</button><button class="btn small secondary" id="cancelEditGoalBtn" style="display:none;">Cancel Edit</button></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sprint 21 — App.Goals: Goal AI (additive; wraps the existing
         computeGoalPlan()/computeGoalStatus() engine above, does not
         recompute or duplicate it) -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:2px;">🤖 Goal AI</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Recommendations and notifications based on your own goals and savings pace. Not professional financial advice.</div>
      <div id="goalAINotifications"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">💡 Recommendations</div><div id="goalAIRecs"></div></div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">📊 By goal type</div><div class="kpi-grid" id="goalAIAnalytics"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Your Goals (priority order)</div>
      <div id="goalsList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ACCOUNTS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-accounts">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">Your Accounts</div>
        <div class="card-note" id="totalMoneyNote"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acct-grid" id="acctGrid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Account</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Name</label><input type="text" id="a_name" placeholder="e.g. HDFC Bank"></div>
        <div><label>Type</label>
          <select id="a_type">
            <option>Cash</option><option>Bank Account</option><option>UPI</option><option>Savings Account</option><option>Credit Card</option><option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Opening Balance (₹)</label><input type="number" id="a_opening" step="0.01" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Icon</label>
          <select id="a_icon">
            <option value="💵">💵 Cash</option><option value="🏦">🏦 Bank</option><option value="📱">📱 UPI</option><option value="💰">💰 Savings</option><option value="💳">💳 Card</option><option value="📦">📦 Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addAccountBtn">+ Add Account</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Transfer Money</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>From</label><select id="tr_from"></select></div>
        <div><label>To</label><select id="tr_to"></select></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="tr_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="tr_date"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;"><div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="tr_notes"></div></div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small teal" id="doTransferBtn">Transfer</button><span class="card-note">Transfers move money between your own accounts — never counted as income or expense.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Net Worth</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Assets include account balances, receivables, and investment current value. Liabilities include debts you owe and credit card outstanding.</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="netWorthKpis"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box" style="padding:16px;"><h4>Net Worth History</h4><canvas id="c_networth"></canvas></div>
  </div>

  <!-- RECURRING -->
  <div class="view" id="view-recurring">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Upcoming</div>
      <div id="upcomingList"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Recurring Transaction</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Name</label><input type="text" id="r_name" placeholder="e.g. Rent"></div>
        <div><label>Type</label><select id="r_type"><option value="expense">Expense</option><option value="income">Income</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="r_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="r_category"></select></div>
        <div><label>Account</label><select id="r_account"></select></div>
        <div><label>Frequency</label>
          <select id="r_frequency"><option value="daily">Daily</option><option value="weekly">Weekly</option><option value="monthly" selected>Monthly</option><option value="yearly">Yearly</option></select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Start Date</label><input type="date" id="r_start"></div>
        <div><label>End Date (optional)</label><input type="date" id="r_end"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addRecurringBtn">+ Add Recurring</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">All Recurring Transactions</div>
      <div id="recurringList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CATEGORIES & TAGS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-categories">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Expense Categories &amp; Subcategories</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Add new categories/subcategories from the Add Entry tab. Only categories/subcategories you added yourself (marked "custom") can be deleted — built-in defaults can't be removed, only added to.</div>
      <div id="catManagerExpense"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Income Sources</div>
      <div id="catManagerIncome"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Tags</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Tags are created automatically when you use them (e.g. #Work) on a transaction. All tags used so far:</div>
      <div class="subcat-list" id="tagManagerList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DEBTS & LOANS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-debts">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Debt / Loan Overview</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="debtKpis"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Debt / Loan</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Type</label><select id="d_type"><option value="owed_to_me">Someone owes me</option><option value="i_owe">I owe someone</option></select></div>
        <div><label>Person / Institution</label><input type="text" id="d_person" placeholder="e.g. Rahul"></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="d_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Interest Rate % (optional)</label><input type="number" id="d_interest" min="0" step="0.1"></div>
        <div><label>Date Given/Taken</label><input type="date" id="d_date"></div>
        <div><label>Due Date (optional)</label><input type="date" id="d_due"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addDebtBtn">+ Add</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Log a Payment / Settlement</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Records a partial (or full) payment against a debt/loan. If an account is selected, it's also recorded as a transfer — never counted as an income/expense. Fully paying off the remaining balance marks it settled automatically.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Debt / Loan</label><select id="dpay_debt"></select></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="dpay_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="dpay_date"></div>
        <div><label>Bank/Cash Account (optional)</label><select id="dpay_account"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small teal" id="dpayBtn">Log Payment</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">All Debts &amp; Loans</div>
      <div id="debtsList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CREDIT CARDS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-creditcards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">Credit Card Overview</div>
        <div class="card-note">Purchases on a card increase its outstanding balance. Bill payments settle it — they're never counted as an expense.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="ccKpis"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="acct-grid" id="ccGrid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Credit Card</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Card Name</label><input type="text" id="ccard_name" placeholder="e.g. HDFC Regalia"></div>
        <div><label>Credit Limit (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_limit" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Current Outstanding (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_outstanding" min="0" step="1" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Billing Date (day of month)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_billingday" min="1" max="31" placeholder="e.g. 5"></div>
        <div><label>Due Date (day of month)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_dueday" min="1" max="31" placeholder="e.g. 25"></div>
        <div><label>Minimum Due (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_mindue" min="0" step="1" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Total Due (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_totaldue" min="0" step="1" value="0"></div>
        <div><label>Interest Rate % APR (optional)</label><input type="number" id="ccard_intrate" min="0" step="0.1" placeholder="e.g. 42"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;"><div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="ccard_notes"></div></div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addCreditCardBtn">+ Add Card</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Record a Purchase</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Adds to the card's outstanding balance and logs it as an expense.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Card</label><select id="ccp_card"></select></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccp_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="ccp_date"></div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="ccp_category"></select></div>
        <div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Description (optional)</label><input type="text" id="ccp_item"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small rust" id="ccPurchaseBtn">Record Purchase</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Record Payment / Bill Settlement</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Card</label><select id="ccpay_card"></select></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="ccpay_amount" min="0" step="0.01"></div>
        <div><label>Date</label><input type="date" id="ccpay_date"></div>
        <div><label>Source Bank/Cash Account</label><select id="ccpay_source"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small teal" id="ccPaymentBtn">Record Payment</button><span class="card-note">Deducts from the source account and reduces outstanding — treated as a transfer, not an expense.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- INVESTMENTS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-investments">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Investment Summary</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="invKpis"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-grid">
      <div class="chart-box"><h4>Portfolio by Type</h4><canvas id="c_invtype"></canvas></div>
      <!-- Sprint 22 — App.Investment: growth trend, additive alongside the
           original "Portfolio by Type" chart above (unchanged). Plotted from
           state.investmentHistory, a new snapshot log recorded automatically
           whenever investments are saved; empty/short history just shows
           noData() the same way the original chart already does elsewhere. -->
      <div class="chart-box"><h4>Growth Trend</h4><canvas id="c_invtrend"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Add Investment</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Investment Name</label><input type="text" id="i_name" placeholder="e.g. Nifty 50 Index Fund"></div>
        <div><label>Type</label>
          <select id="i_type"><option>Mutual Funds</option><option>Stocks</option><option>Fixed Deposit (FD)</option><option>Gold</option><option>Real Estate</option><option>Other</option><option>SIP</option><option>ETF</option><option>Silver</option><option>Recurring Deposit (RD)</option><option>PPF</option><option>EPF</option><option>NPS</option><option>Bonds</option><option>Crypto</option><option>Custom Asset</option></select>
        </div>
        <div><label>Invested Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="i_invested" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Current Value (₹)</label><input type="number" id="i_current" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Purchase Date</label><input type="date" id="i_date"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;"><div style="grid-column:1/-1;"><label>Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="i_notes"></div></div>
      <!-- Sprint 22 — App.Investment: optional advanced fields. Every field
           here is optional and additive — the original 5 fields above and
           the addInvestmentBtn handler's original behavior are unchanged
           for anyone who never opens this section. -->
      <details style="margin-top:12px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;">+ Advanced details (optional): units, price, risk, goal link</summary>
        <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div><label>Units / Quantity (optional)</label><input type="number" id="i_units" min="0" step="any" placeholder="e.g. 12.5"></div>
          <div><label>Avg. Buy Price per Unit (₹, optional)</label><input type="number" id="i_price" min="0" step="any"></div>
          <div><label>Risk Level (optional override)</label>
            <select id="i_risk"><option value="">Auto (based on type)</option><option value="1">1 — Very Low</option><option value="2">2 — Low</option><option value="3">3 — Medium</option><option value="4">4 — High</option><option value="5">5 — Very High</option></select>
          </div>
          <div><label>Link to Goal (optional)</label><select id="i_goal"><option value="">— None —</option></select></div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addInvestmentBtn">+ Add Investment</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Your Investments</div>
      <div id="invList"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sprint 22 — App.Investment: Investment Intelligence (additive; reuses
         state.investments/saveInvestments()/totalInvestedAmount()/
         totalInvestmentValue() above, does not recompute or duplicate them).
         Rule-based only — no live market data, no broker integration, not
         professional financial advice. -->
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:2px;">🧭 Investment Intelligence</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Rule-based insights from your own recorded data — risk, diversification and simple performance comparisons. Not professional financial advice.</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="invAIAnalytics"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">⚖️ Risk Meter</div><div id="invRiskMeter"></div></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">🧩 Diversification &amp; Concentration</div><div id="invConcentration"></div></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">💡 Recommendations</div><div id="invRecs"></div></div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">📈 Performance vs. Benchmarks</div><div id="invPerf"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">🎯 Goal-Linked Investments</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Investments you've linked to a goal above, and how much of that goal they currently cover.</div>
      <div id="invGoalLinked"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">👀 Watchlist</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Track assets you're considering, without adding them to your portfolio yet.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Name</label><input type="text" id="w_name" placeholder="e.g. Nifty Bees ETF"></div>
        <div><label>Type</label><select id="w_type"></select></div>
        <div><label>Target / Notes (optional)</label><input type="text" id="w_notes" placeholder="e.g. buy under ₹250"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="addWatchBtn">+ Add to Watchlist</button></div>
      <div id="invWatchlist" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">📘 Learn: Investment Basics</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Simple, beginner-friendly explanations — written in plain language, for learning only.</div>
      <div id="invGlossary"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><div class="card-note" style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">❓ FAQ</div><div id="invFAQ"></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CASH FLOW FORECAST -->
  <div class="view" id="view-forecast">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">Cash Flow Forecast</div>
        <div class="seg" id="forecastSeg">
          <button data-days="7" class="active">7 Days</button>
          <button data-days="30">30 Days</button>
          <button data-days="60">60 Days</button>
          <button data-days="90">90 Days</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Projected — based on your recorded financial data (ESTIMATE). Formula: Current Balance + Scheduled Recurring Income − Scheduled Recurring Expenses − Upcoming EMIs/Card Dues − Planned Goal Contributions.</div>
      <div class="kpi-grid" id="forecastKpis"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box" style="padding:16px;"><h4>Projected Balance Timeline</h4><canvas id="c_forecast"></canvas></div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Forecast Breakdown</div>
      <div id="forecastTable"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AFFORDABILITY CHECKER -->
  <div class="view" id="view-affordability">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Can I Spend This?</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Checks your planned purchase against available cash, upcoming 30-day commitments, this month's budget room, and your emergency fund status.</div>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div><label>Planned Purchase Name</label><input type="text" id="af_name" placeholder="e.g. New headphones"></div>
        <div><label>Amount (₹)</label><input type="number" id="af_amount" min="0" step="1"></div>
        <div><label>Category</label><select id="af_category"></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions"><button class="btn small" id="afCheckBtn">Check Affordability</button></div>
      <div id="afResult" style="margin-top:16px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SEARCH RESULTS -->
  <div class="view" id="view-search">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Universal Finance Search</div>
      <input type="text" id="searchViewInput" placeholder="Search transactions, dates, categories, amounts…" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
      <div id="searchResultsBody"><div class="empty-note">Type a search above — try "Food", "above 500", "August 2026", "last 7 days", or "Food August".</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DATA -->
  <div class="view" id="view-data">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Google Drive Sync</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:12px;" id="driveStatusText">Not signed in — your data stays only on this device unless you sign in.</div>
      <div class="row-actions" id="driveSignedOutRow">
        <button class="btn small teal" id="driveSignInBtn">Sign in with Google</button>
      </div>
      <div class="row-actions hidden" id="driveSignedInRow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <button class="btn small teal" id="driveBackupNowBtn">Backup to Drive now</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="driveRestoreBtn">Restore from Drive…</button>
        <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;margin:0;">
          <input type="checkbox" id="driveAutoSyncToggle" style="width:auto;"> Auto-backup after changes
        </label>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="driveSignOutBtn">Sign out</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:10px;" id="driveLastSyncText"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Export &amp; Backup</div>
      <div class="row-actions">
        <button class="btn small" id="exportCsvBtn">Export CSV</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="backupBtn">Backup (JSON)</button>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="restoreBtn">Restore from file…</button>
        <button class="btn small rust" id="clearAllBtn">Clear All Data</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:12px;">Your data is saved automatically as you go — nothing is lost on refresh. Use Backup regularly if you want an offline copy.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Import CSV</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:10px;">CSV columns: type,date,category,item,amount,mode,notes</div>
      <button class="btn small secondary" id="importCsvBtn">Choose CSV File…</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Auto-Save &amp; Recovery</div>
      <div class="card-note" id="autosaveStatusText"><span class="autosave-status-dot" id="autosaveStatusDot"></span>All changes save automatically — no Save button needed anywhere in the app.</div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:8px;">In-progress drafts (the New Transaction form and any open OCR scan review) are also saved as you type, so a refresh or a closed tab won't lose what you were entering — you'll see a recovery banner at the top the next time you open Khaata.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- VOICE ASSISTANT -->
  <div class="view" id="view-voice">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">🎙️ Voice Assistant</div>
        <div class="card-note">Ask Khaata, add entries, or navigate — hands-free</div>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Enable voice system</div><div class="tr-note">Turns the mic button on or off everywhere in the app. Off = mic button hidden, nothing listens.</div></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="voiceEnabledToggle" checked><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Recognition language</div><div class="tr-note">Which language the microphone listens for.</div></div>
        <select id="voiceLangSelect" style="width:auto;min-width:150px;">
          <option value="auto">Auto (Hindi + English)</option>
          <option value="en">English</option>
          <option value="hi">Hindi</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Continuous conversation mode</div><div class="tr-note">Mic auto-reopens after each command for ~18s so you can correct or continue without re-tapping. Always exitable instantly.</div></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="voiceContinuousToggle"><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:12px;">🔒 Voice processing happens entirely in your browser using its built-in speech recognition (Web Speech API). No financial data or audio is sent to Anthropic, Khaata, or any external server by this feature. You can revoke microphone access any time in your browser's site settings. The mic never stays on in the background — it stops the moment a command session ends or times out.</div>
      <div class="card-note" id="voiceSupportNote" style="margin-top:8px;"></div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:8px;">This is for quick, single-shot commands. For a real back-and-forth conversation — follow-up questions, spoken confirmations, hands-free mode — use the <b>AI Voice Assistant</b> below, or the 💬 chat button anywhere in the app.</div>
      <!-- Sprint 41 — now that the Home-screen mic FAB (#micFabBtn) goes
           straight into a real conversation instead, this is the only
           remaining entry point into the old single-shot sheet
           (#voiceOverlay). openVoicePanel() is unchanged (Sprint 19-30). -->
      <button class="btn small" id="voiceOldPanelOpenBtn" style="margin-top:10px;" onclick="openVoicePanel()">🎙️ Open Quick Voice Commands</button>
    </div>

    <!-- VOICE ENGINE FOUNDATION (App.Voice) — additive, does not replace the
         working panel above. This section exposes the new voice-interface
         layer (state machine, permission/mic manager, session manager)
         being built out this sprint. It never logs transactions or goal
         changes itself — see the "Try saying…" panel below for that. -->
    <div class="card ve-card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">🧩 AI Voice Assistant (Conversational)</div>
        <div class="card-note">Sprint 19 — the same voice engine, now wired to the real chat assistant (App.Chat) below. Talk naturally; it listens, understands Hindi/English/Hinglish, asks follow-up questions, and reads its replies back.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ve-status-grid">
        <div class="ve-status-tile">
          <div class="ve-label">Engine state</div>
          <div class="ve-value"><span class="ve-dot" id="veStateDot"></span><span id="veStateText">Idle</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ve-status-tile">
          <div class="ve-label">Microphone permission</div>
          <div class="ve-value"><span class="ve-dot" id="vePermDot"></span><span id="vePermText">Unknown</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ve-status-tile">
          <div class="ve-label">Recognition support</div>
          <div class="ve-value"><span class="ve-dot" id="veRecogDot"></span><span id="veRecogText">Checking…</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ve-status-tile">
          <div class="ve-label">Session</div>
          <div class="ve-value"><span id="veSessionText">No active session</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ve-mic-row">
        <button class="ve-mic-btn" id="veMicBtn" title="Start Voice Engine listening">🎙️</button>
        <div class="ve-mic-actions">
          <button class="btn small secondary" id="vePauseBtn">Pause</button>
          <button class="btn small secondary" id="veResumeBtn">Resume</button>
          <button class="btn small secondary" id="veRestartBtn">Restart</button>
          <button class="btn small secondary" id="veCancelBtn">Cancel</button>
          <button class="btn small secondary" id="veResetBtn">Reset Session</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="voice-transcript-box" id="veTranscriptBox"><span class="interim">Foundation layer — transcript preview only, no command is executed from here.</span></div>

      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Preferred language</div><div class="tr-note">Hindi, English, Hinglish, or auto-detect (detection logic itself lands in a future sprint).</div></div>
        <select id="veLangSelect" style="width:auto;min-width:150px;">
          <option value="auto">Auto-detect</option>
          <option value="en-IN">English</option>
          <option value="hi-IN">Hindi</option>
          <option value="hi-en">Hinglish</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Microphone</div><div class="tr-note">Choose which input device the engine listens through.</div></div>
        <select id="veMicSelect" style="width:auto;min-width:150px;max-width:220px;">
          <option value="">Default microphone</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="ve-range-row">
        <label>Speech speed <span id="veRateVal">1.0×</span></label>
        <input type="range" id="veRateRange" min="0.5" max="2" step="0.1" value="1">
      </div>
      <div class="ve-range-row">
        <label>Speech pitch <span id="vePitchVal">1.0</span></label>
        <input type="range" id="vePitchRange" min="0" max="2" step="0.1" value="1">
      </div>
      <div class="ve-range-row">
        <label>Speech volume <span id="veVolumeVal">100%</span></label>
        <input type="range" id="veVolumeRange" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="1">
      </div>

      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Auto-speak responses</div><div class="tr-note">Reads the assistant's replies aloud as they arrive, using the speed/pitch/volume above.</div></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="veAutoSpeakToggle" checked><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Continuous listening (hands-free)</div><div class="tr-note">Keeps the mic re-opening after every reply — including while the assistant is talking, so you can interrupt naturally — until you tap stop.</div></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="veContinuousToggle"><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Voice confirmation mode</div><div class="tr-note">When the assistant asks "Yes, No, or Why?", should it keep listening for your spoken answer automatically?</div></div>
        <select id="veConfirmModeSelect" style="width:auto;min-width:150px;">
          <option value="auto">Auto-listen for my answer</option>
          <option value="manual">Wait for me to tap the mic</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Assistant's name</div><div class="tr-note">Give your assistant a name — used below as the wake word, e.g. "Sona".</div></div>
        <input type="text" id="veAssistantNameInput" maxlength="24" placeholder="Khaata" style="width:auto;min-width:120px;max-width:160px;">
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div><div class="tr-label">Wake word listening</div><div class="tr-note">Say your assistant's name to start listening hands-free — no need to tap the mic. Needs microphone permission; uses more battery while on, and you can turn it off anytime. The mic button above always keeps working, on or off.</div></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="veWakeWordToggle"><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" id="veWakeStatusText" style="margin-top:-4px;">Wake word listening is off.</div>

      <div class="card-note ve-future-note" style="margin-top:10px;">Reserved for future sprints — visible here so settings won't need to move later: <span class="tag">Auto Start</span><span class="tag">Offline Recognition</span></div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:8px;">Tap the mic above to start talking. Every entry it logs still goes through the same spoken/typed "Yes / No / Why?" confirmation as the chat assistant — nothing saves without your explicit OK, and voice can never delete anything. Note: on some mobile browsers, background/continuous listening (including wake word) can be paused by the OS when the screen locks or the app is minimized — if that happens, just tap the mic button as usual.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="card-title">Try saying…</div></div>
      <div class="voice-examples">
        <div><code>Add 200 rupees for coffee</code></div>
        <div><code>Maine 500 rupaye khana pe kharch kiye</code></div>
        <div><code>Paid 1200 for electricity bill by UPI yesterday</code></div>
        <div><code>Add income 40000 salary today</code></div>
        <div><code>What's my balance?</code></div>
        <div><code>How much did I spend on food this month?</code></div>
        <div><code>What's my savings rate?</code></div>
        <div><code>How's my Laptop goal going?</code></div>
        <div><code>Is my emergency fund fully funded?</code></div>
        <div><code>What's my financial health score?</code></div>
        <div><code>What are my upcoming bills?</code></div>
        <div><code>What did I spend yesterday?</code></div>
        <div><code>Open goals</code> · <code>Show budgets</code> · <code>Go to reports</code></div>
        <div><code>Add a goal contribution of 2000 to Laptop</code></div>
        <div><code>Mark Laptop goal as paused</code></div>
        <div><code>Check if I can afford 3000 for shoes</code></div>
        <div><code>Run the forecast for 30 days</code></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:10px;">Voice can never delete anything. Deleting a transaction, goal, account, or recurring item always needs a manual tap on its existing delete button — this is a fixed safety rule, not a setting.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <div class="card-title">Command History</div>
        <button class="btn small secondary" id="voiceHistClearBtn">Clear Log</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card-note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">A transparency log of your own voice commands and what Khaata did with them — separate from your financial data.</div>
      <div id="voiceHistList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot-note">Khaata — every number on this page comes from what you've entered. No simulated data. · v1.33.0</div>
</div>

<!-- Sprint 30 — Two independent floating buttons, per the reference
     mockup: mic (bottom-left, above Home) always visible; "+"
     (bottom-right, above More) expands a 2-item glass menu. Both
     reuse the exact same #micFabBtn / #fabBtn elements and handlers
     every prior sprint used — only position/behavior of the "+"
     menu's contents changed (mic no longer lives inside it). -->
<div class="kh-fab-backdrop" id="khFabBackdrop"></div>
<button class="fab kh-fab-trigger" id="fabBtn" title="Add">+</button>
<div class="kh-fab-tag" id="khPlusTag">Add</div>
<div class="kh-plus-menu" id="khPlusMenu">
  <div class="kh-plus-item" id="khMenuManualEntry">
    <span class="kh-plus-ic">✏️</span>
    <span class="kh-plus-txt"><span class="kh-plus-title">Manual Entry</span><span class="kh-plus-sub">Add transaction manually</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="kh-plus-item" id="khMenuCameraUpload">
    <span class="kh-plus-ic">📷</span>
    <span class="kh-plus-txt"><span class="kh-plus-title">Camera / Upload</span><span class="kh-plus-sub">Scan bill or receipt</span></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bottom-nav kh-bottomnav" id="bottomNav">
  <button data-view="dashboard" class="active"><span class="bn-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11.5 12 4l9 7.5"/><path d="M5.5 10v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1H9a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h2a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9"/></svg></span>Home</button>
