      <div class="more-item scan-option" data-scan="image"><span class="mi-ic">🌄</span>Image</div>
      <div class="more-item scan-option" data-scan="audio"><span class="mi-ic">🎵</span>Audio</div>
      <div class="more-item scan-option" data-scan="video"><span class="mi-ic">🎬</span>Video</div>
      <div class="more-item scan-option" data-scan="browse"><span class="mi-ic">📁</span>Browse Files</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-note" style="margin-top:14px;">OCR and AI document analysis are on the roadmap — for now, scanned files attach to a new entry for you to fill in.</div>
  </div>
</div>

