   QUICK ENTRY — additional types (Sprint 24)
   Investment/Loan/Budget/Goal are shortcuts into their existing
   dedicated forms (fewest-taps still means "reuse the form that
   already knows how to save this correctly" rather than a second,
   simplified copy of the same logic). Reminder is the one type with
   no dedicated tab yet, so it gets a genuine inline quick-save here.
